<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">1 Samuel</book>
  <para style="h">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Samuel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephraim tang gam Ramathaim zophim khua ah mi khat a om a, a min Elkanah ahi. Huai mi Jeroham tapa ahi a, huai mi Elihu tapa ahi a, huai mi Tohu tapa ahi a, huai mi Ephraim mi Zuph tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman zi nih a nei a, a khat min Hannah ahi, a khat min Peninnah ahi. Peninnah in tate a nei a, Hannah in bel tate a neikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai mi a khua ua kipan Shiloh ah Sepaihpawlte Toupa houpih ding leh kithoih din kumteng in a hohtou hi. Huai ah Eli tapate nih, Hophni leh Phinehas, Toupa siampute a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Elkanah kithoih ni a hongtun in, a zi Peninnah leh a tapate leh a tanute tengteng tantuan a bawlsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hannah tan nih a bawlsak a, Hannah lah a it mahmah ngal a. Himahleh Toupa’n a sul a khak sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n a sul a khak sak ziak in a melma in a lungkham saknak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchibang a kumtenga a hih ziak in Toupa inn a hohtouh teng in a lungkhamna a tokthou nak hi. Huchi in a kapkap a, an leng a ne kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A pasal Elkanah in a kiang ah, “Hannah, bang a chia ahia na kah? Bang a chia an ne lou na hia? Bang a chia lungkham na hia? Tapa sawm sang in nang adin ka hoihzaw ka hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in, Shiloh a a nek ua a dawn khit un Hannah ading a, siampu Eli Toupa biakin kong khuambul a a tutna ah a tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hannah lungsim haksa mahmah in a om a, Toupa kiang ah a thum a, khase mahmah in a kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu a chiam a, “Sepaihte Toupa aw, na sikhanu gimna en a, n’on theihgige a, na sikhanu n’on mangngilh louh a, na sikhanu tapa na piak leh, a damsung teng Toupa ka pedia, a lu met ahi kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Toupa ma a a thum sanlai in Eli in a mukphun a na chiamteh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hannah in a lungtang in a gen a, a muk kia a tangsak a, a aw bel zak ahi kei hi. Huaiziak in Eli in zukham a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in Eli in a kiang ah, “Bang tan ahia kham a na om nilouh ding? Na uain koihmang in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hannah in, “Kham kei veng e, ka toupa. Lungsim lungkham mahmah numei ka hi. Uain leng, Zu chik leng ka dawn kei, Toupa ma ah ka lungsim ka suahkhia ahizaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na sikhanu Belial tanu in honngoh hetken. Lungsim a dimlet ka lungkimlouhna leh ka lungkhamna genkhia ka hi zaw hi” chi’n a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eli in, “Lungmuangtak in pai in, Israelte Pathian in na thil nget nang honpia hen” chi in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman, “Na sikhanu na mitmuh in deihsakna musak in” a chi hi. Huchi in numei a paita a, an a ne a, lungkham mel a puta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zingsangpi in a thou ua, Toupa a bia ua, a pai ua, Ramah khua a inn uh a tungnawnta uh. Elkanah in a zi Hannah a luppih a, Toupa’n amah a theigige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Hannah in nau a pai a, a hun a hongtun in tapa a nei hi.“ Toupa ka nget ziak in” chi in a min Samuel a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in, Elkanah leh a inkawte tengteng Toupa ma a kumteng a a kithoihna uh lan ding leh a thuchiam uh tangtun din a hong paitou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hannah bel a hohtou kei hi. A pasal kiang ah, “Kei zaw naupang in nawinek a tawp masiah ka hohtou kei ding. Huai hun chiang in Toupa ma a kilat theihna din ka pi ding. Huai ah a om nilouhta ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pasal Elkanah in a kiang ah, “Hoih di na chih bangzel in hih in. A nawinek na tawpsak tan in om in. Himahleh Toupa’n a thu hihkip lel hen” a chi hi. Huchi in nawinek a tawp masiah numei bel a omta a, a tapa nawinek a tawp masiah nawi a nesak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nawinek a tawp tak in, tangbuang ephah khat leh uain thawl khat tawi in bawngtal thum toh Shiloh a Toupa inn ah a ta naupang chik paipih in, a pitou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawngtal khat a gou in, naupang Eli kiang ah a pi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aman, “Toupa, na hinna lou in ka gen ahi, kei zaw aw, toupa, hiai lai a na kiang a ding a Toupa kiang a thum numei ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hiai naupang ngen in ka thum a, Toupa’n ka nget a honpeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huaiziak in ken leng Toupa kiang ah ka lan hi. A damsung teng Toupa adia lat ahi” a chi hi. Huai ah aman Toupa a bia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Hannah a thum a hichi in a chi hi: “Ka lungtang Toupa tung ah a kipak mahmah, ka ki Toupa ah pahtawi in a om. Ka melmate tung ah ka kam letsak in a om a, na hotdamna a ka kipah mahmah ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Toupa bang a siangthou a omkei uh. Nang bang mahmah lah a om ngalkei uh. I Pathian bang suangpi himhim leng a omsam kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi tel a kisathei in thu gennawn kei unla; na kam ua pan pau uang himhim pawt kei hen. Toupa lah pilna Pathian ahi ngal a, aman thilhihte hoihtak in a bukzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi hat thalpeute a kitansak a, a kisuite taihatna a gak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Niang leh tai a omte nekding zong in a lohtawm ua, gilkialte kial nawnlou uhi. A chingnu’n ta sagih a neita a, ta tampi neinu a bahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n a that a, a hingsak hi. Han ah a paisuk sak a, a pikhe tou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n a zawngsaka, a hausa sak a, a hihniam a, a hihsang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leivui apan a zawngte ading tousak a, ekvu apan khutdohte a dom tou hi. Mi liante kiang a a omsak theih a, thupina mangtutphah a tan theihna ding un. Lei kingaknate Toupa a ahi a, aman khovel lah a tung uah a ngata ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“A misiangthoute khe a kem dia, migiloute bel miallak ah daihsak in a om ding uh. Hatna a kuamah in zoulou ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa melmate a kitam gawp ding ua, van apan vanpiging bang in amaute a dou ding. Toupa’n kawlmong pha in vai a hawm dia; a kumpipa kiang ah hatna a pedia, a thaunilhpa ki a pahtawi ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Elkanah bel Ramah ah a inn ah a paita hi. Huchi in naupang in siampu Eli ma ah Toupa na a semta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eli tapate Belial tate ahi ua; Toupa a theikei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mite lak a siampute hihdan ngeina ahihleh min kithoihna a honglat chiang un, sahuan laitak in siampu sikha sa thukna sikkhut zum thum nei tawi in a hongpai zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Belgong za hiam, belgong nei hiam, belkhaina nei hiam, bel hiam sung a sunsuka, huai sa thukna zum in a hon thukkhiak tengteng siampu in a lazel hi. Huchibang in Israel mi huai a hongpai tengteng apan Shiloh khua ah a na hihsak zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thau a khul ma un siampu sikha a hongpai a, kithoihmi kiang ah, “siampu ading haimin ding sa honpia in. Na sa huan a deihkei, a sial a deih hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Min a kiang ah, “A thau pen khul phot uhenla, huaikhit chiang in na hinna in a deih zahzah na la ding” a na chih chiang un aman, “Hilou e, tu mah a n’on piakpah ding ahi. N’on piak kei leh thagum in ka la ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in tangvalte khelhna Toupa mitmuh in a thupi mahmah a, mite’n lah Toupa kiang a kithoihna lat thilkihhuai in a ngaita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Himahleh Samuel in bel naupang mahleh, puanmalngat siampu puanak silh in Toupa ma ah na a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huailou leng a nun puanaktual neu a khui sak a, kumteng kithoihna uh lan dia a pasal toh a hoh chiang un kumteng in a tawisak zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eli in Elkanah leh a zi a vualzawl a, “ Toupa adia na thillat uh mun luah ding numei suan Toupa’n honpia hen” a chi hi. Huchi in a in uah a paita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa’n Hannah a veh a, nau a pai a, tapa thum leh tanu nih a nei hi. Naupang Samuel Toupa ma ah a hong khang lianta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eli bel a tek mahmahta hi. Israel mi tengteng tung a a tate thilhih tengteng leh Kihoupihna Puanin kongkhak bul a nasem numeite a na luppih zel thute uh a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in a kiang uah, “Bangdia hichibang thilhih na mai ua? Hiai mi tengteng apan na thilhih dan hoihloute uh ka naza ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hichi di hilou ahi, Ka tate aw, na tanchin uh ka zak a hoihlou lam ngen ahi. Toupa mite na taleksak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi khat, midang tung a a khelh leh Pathian in vai a hawmsak ding hi. Himahleh Toupa tung a mi a khelh leh kuan amah adin a ngetsak dia?” a chi hi. Huchi pipi in leng a pa uh aw a ngaikhe kei ua, Toupa’n amaute a thah ding ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Naupang Samuel a khang lian deuhdeuh a; Pathian leh mihing deihsak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Eli kiang ah Pathian mi khat a hong a, a kiang ah, “ Toupa’n hichi in a chi. ‘Aigupta gam a Pharo inn a na omlai un na pa inkawte kiang ah ka kilak kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel nam tengteng lak apan ka siampu hi ding, ka maitam a thillan ding, gimlim hal ding leh siampu puanak silh dia amah ka tel ahi kei maw? Na pa inkawte kiang ah Israel mite haltum thillat teng ka pia ahi kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bangziak in ahia ka tenna a na lat ding ua ka thupiak ka kiang a kithoihna leh kei a tuam dia thillat pen lei toh sikden a, kei sang a na tate na zahtak zawk a, noumau na kisukthauna dia ka mi Israelte kithoihna a hoih pente na zat uh?’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Israelte Pathian in, ‘Ken zaw na inkawte leh na pa inkawte tangtawn in ka ma ah na om ding uh,’ ka na chi ngei hi. Himahleh tuin Toupa’n , ‘Na om hetkei ding uh. Hon zahtak peuhmah ka zahtak dia, hon musit peuhmah ka musit ding,’ a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngai in, ‘na bante leh na pa inkawte bante ka tankhiat ni a hongtung, na inn ah tekkun a dam a omkei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka tenna inn ah, Pathian in Israel hauhsakna a piak teng ah melma na mu dia, tangtawn in na inn ah tekkun a dam a omkei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ka maitam apan ka hihman louh ding na mi pen na mit hihkhamtu leh na lungsim lungkham saktu ahi ding. Na inn a hongpiang peuhmah a dawnsih zel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hiai, na tapate nih Hophni leh Phinehas tung a thiltung ding nang adin chiamtehna ahi ding. Ni khat in a nih un a si tuaktuak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kei adin siampu muanhuai ka ding khesak dia, huai in ka lungtang leh ka lungsim toh kituak in na a sem ding. Inkuan kiptak in ka lamsak dia, tangtawn in ka thaunilhmi ma ah a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, na inn a omlai tengteng dangka leh tanghou ngen in a kiang ah a kuan ding ua, tanghou tawmchik bek nekding ka muh theihna ding un siampu na khat bek hon semsak ve aw, chi’n k’ong thum hi, a chi ding uh’ ” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Naupang Samuel in Eli ma ah Toupa na a sem hi. Huailai in Toupa thutung a vang mahmah a; a langtang a kilaknate a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, huailai in, Eli a mun a a luplai in, a mit a mial panta a, khua a gina muhthei nawn ngelkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian khawnvak a mih ma in, Pathian bawm omna Toupa biakin ah Samuel ihmu din a lumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“ Toupa’n Samuel a sam a”; aman, “Hiai ah ka om” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eli kiang ah a vatai a, a kiang ah, “Hiai ah ka om, n’on sam a” a chi hi. Aman, “K’on sam kei; va lum nawn in,” a chi hi. Huchi in a pai a, a va lum nawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n Samuel a sam nawn hi. Samuel a thou a, Eli kiang ah a hoh a, “Hiai ah ka om, n’on sam a” a chi hi. Aman a dawng a, “K’on sam kei, ka tapa, valum nawn in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huailai in Samuel in Toupa a thei naikei a, Toupa thu leng a kiang a kilaksak ahi naikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n Samuel a sam nawn a, huai a thumveina ahita. Amah a thou a, Eli kiang ah a hoh a, “Hiai ah ka om, n’on sam a” a chi hi. Huchi in Eli in naupang Toupa’n sam ahi chih a theita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Eli in Samuel kiang ah, “Pai inla, va lum nawn inla, a hon sap nawn leh, Toupa , thu gen in, na sikha in a ngaikhia hi, na chi ding” a chi hi. Huchi in Samuel a paita a, a mun ah a va lum nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa a hongpai a, hong ding in, a ma a a sap bang in, “Samuel, Samuel” a chi hi. Huchi in Samuel in, “Thu gen in, na sikha in a ngaikhia hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n Samuel kiang ah, “Ngai in, Israel gam ah a za peuhmahte bil langnih a aphuaitakin thil khat ka hih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai ni’n a inkuan tung tangthu ka gen tengteng a bul apan a tawp tan in Eli tung ah ka hih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tate’n Pathian a gensiatna khelhna uh theigigena pi a, a kham louh ziak in a inkuan tangtawn adin ka hawmsak ding hi, chih ka hilh khinta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Eli inkuan kiang ah Eli inkuan bohsiatna kithoihna in hiam, thillat in hiam, chikchiang in leng siansak theih ahi kei ding, chi in ka kichiam khinta hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuel zingsang tan in a lum a, Toupa inn kongkhakte a honghi. Samuel in huai kilakna Eli theihsak a lau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in Eli in Samuel a sam a, “Samuel, ka tapa” a chi hi. Aman, “Hiai ah ka om” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman, “Bang thil ahia Toupa’n na kiang a a gen? Ka kiang ah bangmah imken aw. Na kiang a a gen tengteng ka kiang a im na neih leh na tung ah Pathian in a hihhih in hih henla, huai sang a thupizaw in leng” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Samuel in thil tengteng a hilh sipsip a, a kiang ah bangmah im a neikei. Huchi in aman, Toupa thuthu ahi mahve, hoih a sak bang in hih hen, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Samuel a hong khanglian deuhdeuh a, a kiang ah Toupa a om a, a thu himhim leitung ah a kesak kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in Dan apan Beer–sheba tan in Israel mi tengteng in Toupa zawlnei dia Samuel hihkip ahi, chih a na theita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa Shiloh ah a kilak nawn a; Toupa thu in Samuel kiang ah Shiloh a kilak lah ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Samuel thu Israel mi tengteng lak ah a thangkheta hi. Israel mite Philistia mite dou din a kuan khia uh. Ebenezer kiang ah panmun a khoh ua, Philistia mite’n Aphek ah panmun a khoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Philistia mite Israel mite na dal din a na kiphalh uh. A hong kidou uleh Philistia mite ma ah Israel mite a zahlakta ua, kidouna mun ah sepaih sang li vel a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mipite a giahmun ua a vapai uleh Israel upate’n, “Bangziak in ahia tuni a Toupa’n Philistia mite ma a hon zahlaksak mahmah? I kiang ua om a i melmate khut apan hon hondam din Shiloh apan Toupa thukhun bawm i va la ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in mipite’n Shiloh ah mi a sawl ua, huai apan Cherubim tung a tu, sepaihte Toupa thukhun bawm a vala ua; huai ah Pathian thukhun bawm toh Eli tapate nih Hophni leh Phinehas a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa thukhun bawm a giahmun uh a hongtun in, Israel mi tengteng ngaihtak in a kikou zuazua ua, lei nangawn a thawn ging zuazua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Philistia mite’n a kikou husa uh a zak un, “Hebrute giahmuna kikou husa gingta zuazua mai bang chihna ahia leh?” a chi uh. A giahmun uah Toupa thukhun bawm a hongtung ahi, chih a theita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Philistia mite’n a lau ua, “Giahmun ah Pathian a hong hi” a chih ziak un. “I tung a gik hi! Tuma lam in huchibang a om ngei ngal kei a, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I tung a gik hi! Huai Pathiante khut hattak apan kua in ahia hon hondam ding? Huai Pathiante ahi, Aigupta mite gamdai a hipi chiteng a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw, nou Philistia mite aw, nou sikha ua a om bang ua nou Hebrute sikha a na omlouhna ding un hattak in om unla, ki pasal sakun. Ki pasal sakunla sual un” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Philistia mite’n a sual ua, Israel mite a zahlak sak ua, michih a puanin lam chiat uah a taikek uhi. A nakthah mahmah ua, Israelte sepaih sing thum a si uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian bawm a laksak ua, Eli tapa nih, Hophni leh Phinehas leng a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sepaih lak a Benjamin suan, mi khat a tai a, a puankhawng kikek nengnungin leh a lu a leikai niaunuau in huai ni mahmah in Shiloh a va tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hongtun in, ngai in, Eli in lampi gei a tutna a tukawm in a na en nilouh a, Pathian bawm ziak in a lungtang a ling ngal a. Min khua a tun a tanchin a gen leh a khaw miteng a kapkhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eli in a kikou husa uh a zak in, “Tua thawm ging vengvung bang chihna ahia?” a chi hi. Mi khat kintak in a va hoh a, Eli a va hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eli bel kum sawmkua leh giat a upa ahi a, a mit a mialta a, khua a mu thei nawn kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai mi’n Eli kiang ah, “Sepaih lak apan hong paikhia ka hi. Tuni a sepaih lak apan hong taikhia ka hi” a chi hi. Aman, “Ka tapa, bangchibang in thil a om a oi?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tanchin hontun pa’n a dawng a, “Israel mite Philistia mite ma ah a taikek ua, mipi lak ah kithahna thupitak a omlai a, na tapate nih Hophni leh Phinehas leng a si uh, Pathian bawm leng a lak sakta uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Pathian bawm thu a gentakin kongpi bul a tutphah apan a thalpuk a, a ngawng a kitan a, a sita hi. Amah tekta a kikhouh zou nawn lou a hih ziak in. Israel tung ah kum sawmli sung vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A mounu, Phinehas zi in a naupai a, a neih a hun mahmahta hi. Aman Pathian bawm laksak a hih thu leh a pu leh a pasal a si uh chih a zak in a kun suk a, nau a veita hi, a na in phata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A sihdek lai in a kiang a ding numeite’n a kiang ah, “Lau ken, tapa na neita” a chi uhi. Himahleh a dawng hetkei a, a limsak sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Thupina in Israel a pawtsanta” chi in nau min Ikabod, a sa hi. Pathian bawm lah a laksakta ua, a pa leh a pasal lah a sita ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Thupina in Israel a pawtsanta, Pathian bawm lah a lak sakta ngal ua” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Philistia mite’n Pathian bawm a la ua, Ebenezer apan Ashdod ah a paipih uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Philistia mite’n Pathian bawm a la ua, Dagon inn ah a la lut ua, Dagon kiang ah a koih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ashdod khomite a zing khangpi a, a thoh uleh, ngai in, Toupa bawm ma ah Dagon a mai a leisi in a na puk vialvual mawk hi. Dagon a la ua, a omna mun ah a koih nawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A zing nawn zing khangpi a, a thoh uleh, ngai in, Toupa bawm ma ah Dagon a mai a leisi in a na puk vialvual mawk a; Dagon lu leh a khutpek bawm lang nih ki tankhia kongpi bul ah a na kikham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Dagon siampu hiam, Dagon in a hongpaite in leng Ashdod a Dagon inn bul tunitan in a sikngam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa khut Ashdod khua mite tung ah a gik a, amaute a hihsia a, Ashdod khua leh a kiang vel a omte zangtan hipi in a gawtta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Ashdod a mite’n huchibang thiltung a muh un, “Israelte Pathian bawm i kiang uah om gige kei hen, eimah leh i pathian Dagon tung ah a khutkhak a na tel mai” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />huaiziak in, Philistia hausa tengteng a kiang uah a samkhawm ua, “Israelte Pathian bawm bang i loh dia?” a chi uh. Amau, “Israelte Pathian bawm Gath ah puak hi hen” chi in a dawng uhi. Huchi in Israelte Pathian bawm Gath ah a paipihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hichi a honghi a, a paipih lai un Toupa khut in huai khua a hihseta hi. Khomite a lian leh a neu a gawt vek a, a tung uah zangtan hipi a leng sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian bawm Ekron ah a tun ua, Ekron khomite’n Israelte Pathian bawm eite leh i mite that din i kiang a hon tunta uh, chi in a kikou veng vung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Philistia hausa tengteng a samkhawm ua, “Israelte Pathian bawm paimang sak unla, koute leh ka mite a hon thah louhna din a omna mun ngei ah pai nawn hen” a chi uh. Khaw pumpi ah sihna khop siatna a om a, Pathian khut lah huai khua ah a gik mahmah ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A siloute’n zangtan a veichiat ua, huai khaw kikou husa van ah a tungtou hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa bawm Philistia mite gam ah kha sagih sung a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Philistia mite’n, “ Toupa bawm bang i loh ding ua? A omna ngei mah a paisak nawn dan honhilh dihve ua” chi in a siampute leh aisansiamte a sam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amau, “Israelte Pathian bawm na paisak ding uleh leng a vuak in paisak hetkei un. A kiang ah tatlek kithoihna lan ngeingei un. Huchi in hihdam in na om ding uh. Huchi in bangdia a khut nou apan lakkhiat a omlou ahia chih na thei ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in amau, “A kiang a ka tatlekna thillat ding bang ahia?” a chi uh. Amau, “Philistia hausate zah dangkaeng zangtan lim nga leh dangkaeng sansim lim nga; na vek ua tung leh na hausate uh tung a leng hipi lah khat ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaiziak in, na zangtan lim uh leh na gam uh hihsetu sansim limte bawl un. Israelte Pathian thupina pia un, huchi in a khut na tung uah, na pathiante uleh na gam uh tung ah a zang sak nuam khamoh kei ding” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aigupta mite leh Pharo in lungsim a khauhsak bang un bangdia na lungtang uh khauh sak na hi ua? A lak ua thillamdang a hih in mite paisak in a pawtkhe sak uh, hilou maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in, tuin kangtalai thak sutuah unla, bawngpi nih a nawi suklai, hakkol paw ngeilou toh; huai bawngpite kangtalai ah khih unla, a noute uh amau apan in ah honpi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa bawm la unla, kangtalai ah koih unla; tatlek thoihna dia na lat uh dangkaeng thil pen singlem ah thun in a sik ah koih unla, paisak unla, khah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in gamgi lampang lampi tawn in Beth-shemesh ah a pai hiam en un, a pai leh i tung ua thil hoihlou tak amah hih a na hi dia; a paikei leh ei hon gawtpa amah khut a na hi kei chih i thei ding ua, i tung ua hong omsam himhim lel ahi ding, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mite’n huchibang in a hih ua; bawngpi a nawi suklai nih a pi ua, kangtalai ah a khih ua, a noute uh bel in lam ah a khum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa bawm kangtalai ah a koih ua, dangkaeng sansim lim leh zangtan lim koihna singlem toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawngpite’n Beth-shemesh lam zuan in lampi a zui vengveng ua; huchi in ham kawmkawm in lampi a zui ua, taklam ah hiam, veilam ah hiam a pial hetkei uh. Philistia hausate’n Beth-shemesh gamgi pha in a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Beth-shemesh khomite’n phaizang ah buh a na la ua, a daktou ua, bawm a mu ua, a kipahpih mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huai Kangtalai Beth-shemesh a mi Joshua lou ah a lut a, suangpi lian mahmah omna tak ah a khawlta hi. Kangtalai sing a ek ua, bawngpite Toupa kiang ah haltum thillat in a lanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Levi chite’n Toupa bawm dangkaeng thil omna singlem toh a la khia ua, suangpi tung ah a koih uh. Beth-shemesh khomite’n huai ni mah in haltum thillatte leh kithoihnate Toupa kiang ah a lan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai Philistia hausa ngate’n a muh nung un, huai ni mahmah in Ekron kholam ah a pai nawnta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Philistia mite’n dangkaeng zangtan lim Toupa kiang a tatlek thoihna dia a lat uh, Ashdod khaw tuam adin khat, Gaza khaw tuam adin khat, Ashkelon khotuam adin khat, Gath khotuam adin khat, Ekron khaw tuam adin khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dangkaeng sansim lim ahihleh khaw tengteng kulh nei khua leh singtang lam khua leng sim vek a hausa ngate a Philistia mite khaw zah ahi. Toupa bawm a ngakna suangpi mahmah uh Beth-shemesh khaw mi Joshua lou ah tunitan in a om nilouh lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa bawm sung a et ziak un Beth-shemesh khomite Aman a gawt a, a lak ua mi sang nga leh sawmsagih tak a that hi. Toupa’n a nak thah ziak in mite’n sun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Beth-shemesh khomite’n, hiai Pathian siangthou Toupa ma ah kua ading thei in ei apan kua kiang ah ahia a paitouh ding? a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in Kiriath-jearim khomite kiang ah, “Philistia mite’n Toupa bawm a hong koih nawn ua, hongsuk unla na kiang uah latou dih ua” chi a hilh din thupaw mite a sawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Kiriath-jearim khua a mite a hohsuk ua, Toupa bawm a la tou ua; tang a Abinadab inn ah a lalut ua, a tapa Eleazar Toupa bawm kemtu in a septuam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Kiriath-jearim a bawm a omsung sawtpi, kum sawmnih tak ahi. Huchi in Israel inkuan tengteng in Toupa a lungzuan nawnta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Samuel in Israel inkuan tengteng kiang ah, “Na lungtang tengteng uh toh Toupa lam hong nga na hih taktak uleh, gamdang pathiante leh Ashtaroth na lak ua kipan koihmang unla, na lungtang uh Toupa adin kisakhol sak un. Amah kia na sem un; huchi in Philistia mite khut apan nou a hon tankhe ding hi” chi in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in Israel mite’n Baal leh Ashtaroth a koihmang ua, Toupa na kia a semta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samuel in, “Israel mi tengteng Mizpah ah samkhawm vek unla, Toupa kiang ah k’on thumsak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Mizpah ah a paikhawm ua, tui a tawi ua, Toupa ma ah a sungbua uh. Huai ni’n an a ngawl ua, huai ah Toupa tung ah i na khialta uhi, a chi uh. Samuel in Mizpah ah Israel mite vai a hawmsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Philistia mite’n Israel mite Mizpah ah a omkhawm uh chih a zak un, Israel mite sual din Philistia hausate a kisa tou ua, Israel mite’n huai a na zak un Philistia mite a lauta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Israel mite’n Samuel kiang ah, “Philistia mite khut apan hon hondam dia Toupa i Pathian n’on sapsak tawp ken” a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Samuel in belamnou nawi nelai a la a, haltum thillat in Toupa kiang ah a lan hi. Israel mite adin Samuel in Toupa a sam a, Toupa’n a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Samuel in haltum thillat a latlai tak in Philistia mite’n Israel mite sual din a honnaih uh. Himahleh huai ni’n Toupa’n Philistia mite tung ah ngaihtak in van a gingsaka, a buaigawpsak a, Israel mite ma ah zoh in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel mite Mizpah apan a pawt ua, Philistia mite a delh ua, Bethkar nuai a tun tan un a that zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in Samuel in suang a la a, Mizpah leh Shen kikal ah a phut a, “Hiai tan Toupa’n a hon panpih hi” chi in a min ‘Ebenezer’ a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Philistia mite a zahlakta ua, Israel gam ah a hoh nawnta kei uh. Huchi in Samuel damsung tengteng Philistia mite’n Toupa khut in a dousak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Philistia mite’n Israel mite khua a lakte uh Ekron apan Gath tan in Israel mite a penawn vek uh. A gam Israel mite’n Philistia mite khut apan a tankheta uhi. Israel mite leh Amor mite kilem in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in a damsung teng Samuel in Israelte vai a hawmsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kum teng in Bethel leh Gilgal leh Mizpah a vehzel a; huai mun teng ah Israelte vai a hawmsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A in omna a hih ziak in Ramah khua ah a pai nawn zelzel hi. Huai ah Israel mite vai a hawmsak hi. Huai ah Toupa adin maitam khat a doh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, Samuel a upata a, a tapate Israel mite tung a vaihawmmi in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ta masapen min Joel ahi a, a zom min Abijah ahi. Amaute Beer–sheba a vaihawmmite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh a tate’n a ma omdan a lakei ua, sum leh pai a delh ua, golhna a la ua, dik a vaihawmna a kaikawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in Israel mite upate tengteng a kikhawm ua, Ramah khua ah Samuel kiang ah a hoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kiang ah, “Ngai in, na upa mahmahta a, na tapate’n lah na omdan a lakei hial uh. Namdang tengteng bang a ka tung ua vaihawm ding kumpipa hon bawlsak in” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh a kiang a, “Ka tung ua vaihawm ding kumpipa honpia in” a chih un Samuel a kipaksak kei hi. Huchi in Samuel Toupa kiang ah a thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n Samuel kiang ah, “Mite’n na kiang a, a gen tengteng uh ngaikhia in. Nang hon deihlou ahi kei ua, a tung ua kumpipa dia kei hondeih lou ahizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta gam apan ka pikhiak ni apan tutan a a thilhih dan tengteng uh, hon lehngatsan a pathian dangte na a hon sepsan zel uh mah bang in nang tung ah a hih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in, a thu uh ngaikhia in. Himahleh chitaktak in vauhilh inla, a tung ua vaihawmmi kumpipa tatdan ding kawkmuh in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Samuel in Toupa thu tengteng kumpipa ngen mipite a hilhvek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Na tung ua vaihawmmi ding kumpipa tatdan hichibang ahi ding. Na tapate uh a la dia, amah mah ading, sakol kangtalai ading leh a sakol tungtuangmite ding in a sep ding. A khente a sakolkangtalai ma ah a tai ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A sepaih sang heutu ding leh sawmnga heutu ding a sep dia; khenkhatte a leilet ding, a buhla ding, galvante bawl ding, a kangtalai van bawl ding in a zang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tanute uh gimlim bawl ding, anhuan ding leh tanghou bawl din a zang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na lou, na grephuan, olive huan a a hoih tata a honsut dia, a sikhate a pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na haichi leh na grephuan a sawm a khat a hon laksak dia; a sikhate leh heutute a pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na sikhapate, na sikhanute, na tangval hoihhoihte leh na bawngte a honsut dia, a nasem din a zang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na belamhon lak a sawm a khat a hon laksak dia; nou a sikhate na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in na tel ding uh kumpipa ziak in na kapkhe ding uh. Himahleh huai hun chiang in Toupa’n a hon ngaikhe kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh mipite’n Samuel thu a zui nuam kei uh. “Ahi kei, kumpipa i neih ngeingei ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in namdang tengteng bang i honghi dia, i kumpipa’n vai a hon hawmsak dia, i namte pi in galte a hon doupih ding” a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Samuel in mipite thugen tengteng a za a, Toupa bil ah a gen sawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa’n Samuel kiang ah, a thu uh la inla, kumpipa bawlsak in, a chi hi. Samuel in Israel mite kiang ah, “Michih noumau khua chiat ah paita un,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Benjamin gam a Benjamin suan mi khat mi hat leh hangsan mahmah a om a, a min Kish ahi. Huai mi Abiel tapa ahi a, huai mi Zeror tapa ahi a, huai mi Bekorath tapa ahi a, huai mi Aphia tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman tapa khat a nei a, a min Saul ahi. Tangval deihhuai tak ahi a, Israel mite lak ah amah sang a deihhuai himhim a omkei. Kuamah a liangzang khup leng a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saul pa Kish sabiltungte a mang hi. Kish in a tapa Saul kiang ah, “Thou inla, sikha khat pi inla sabiltungte va zong dihve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in Ephraim tanggam ah a vak a, Shalisha gam ah a vak hi. Himahleh a mu kei uh. Huchi in Shalim gam ah a vak ua, huai ah leng a mu kei uh. Benjamin mite gam ah a vaknawn ua, himahleh a mu tuankei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zuph gam a tun un Saul in a kiang a om a sikha kiang ah, “Kisa dih, i pai nawn mai ding, huchih kei leh ka pa’n sabiltungte awlmoh nawnlou in ei a hon ngaihtuah zaw kha ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman a kiang ah, “Ngai in, hiai khua ah Pathian mi a om a, mi zahtakhuai tak ahi. A gen peuhmah a hongtung ngeingei nak hi. Kisa in, huai ah i hoh ding, i hohna lampi a hon hilhthei zenzen khak leh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Saul in a sikha kiang ah, “Ahi na a, ngai dih, hoh hita le hang, huai mi ading bang i tawi dia? I bawm ah lah tanghou a om nawn kei. Pathian mi kipahman tawi ding a om hetkei hi. Bang i nei a eita?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikha in Saul a dawng nawn a, “Ngai in, dangka sekel mun li a khen, mun khat ka tawilai hi. Hiai i hohna ding a honhilh man din Pathian mi ka pe ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuma siah Israelte lak a min Pathian dot a ut leh, “Kisa dih, mutheipa kiang ah i hoh ding, a chi nak uh. Tulai a zawlnei a chih uh tuma lam in mutheipa a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Saul in a sikha kiang ah, “Hoih geih e, va hoh peuhmah ni,” a chi hi. Huchi in Pathian mi omna khua ah a hohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khozotna lampi a a paitouh lai un nungak tuitawi dia hong kuante a mu ua, a kiang uah, “Hiai ah mutheipa a om hia?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amau a dawng ua, “Om mah e, ngai in, na ma uah a pai, kin un, tuni in khua ah a na hoh hi. Tuni in munsang ah mite a kithoih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khua a na luttouh tak un mun sang a an ne dia a hoh ma in na va mungal ding uh. Kithoihna vualzawlpa ding a hih ziak in a tun mateng mipi’n an a nekei ding uh. Huaikhit chiang in a misapte un an a ne zel uhi. Huaiziak in hohtou meng unla, na va mu pah ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in, khua ah a hohtou uh. Khua a lut uleh, ngai in, Samuel munsang a hoh ding in amau a kituahpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul hong ma ni khat in Samuel kiang ah Toupa a kilak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Zingchiang in hichi hun in Benjamin gam apan na kiang ah mi khat k’on hohsak dia, ka mi Israelte tung a heutu ding in thau na nilh ding ahi. Aman Philistia mite khut apan ka mite a hondam ding. A kikou husa uh ka kiang a hongtun tak ziak in ka mite zaw ka limsak ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Samuel in Saul a muh in Toupa’n a kiang ah, “En dih, na kiang a ka mi gen; amahmah in ka mite tung ah vai a hawm ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in kulh kongpi ah Saul in Samuel a va naih a, “Mutheipa inn koilai a om ahia, honhilh dihve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Samuel in Saul a dawng a, “Kei huai mutheipa ka hi. Ka ma ah mun sang lam zuan in pai inla, tuni in ka kiang ah an nane ding hi. Zingchiang zingsang in k’on paisak ding. Na lungtang a om tengteng leng k’on hilh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ni thum paita a mang na sabiltung thu lunghimawh ken. Muh ahita uh. Israelte lunggulh kua tung ah ahia a om? Nang leh na pa inn a mi tengteng tung ah ahi kei maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul in a dawng a, “Israel nam lak a neupen, Benjamin nam ka hi kei maw? Ka inkuan leng Benjamin inkuan tengteng lak a neupen ahi kei maw? Bangchidan a hichidan ka kiang a gen na hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Samuel in Saul leh a sikha a pi a, mikhual indan ah a pilut a, a sap uh, mi sawmthum lak ah mun zahtakhuai ah a tusak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Samuel in anhuan mi kiang ah, “Na kiang a koihtuam ding ka chih, tantuan k’on piakpen honla dih” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in anhuan mi in a phei leh a tung a om a hontawi a, Saul ma ah a lui hi. Samuel in, “En dih, ka na koihtuam, um inla ne in. A hun sehsa adia hiai mite ka chialkhawm lai a k’on sehsak him ahi, ka na chita ngal a” a chi hi. Huchi in huai ni’n Saul in Samuel toh Ankuang a umkhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Munsang apan khua a hong paisuk un intung ah Saul in Samuel a houpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zing khangpi in a thou a; nisuah kuan in Samuel in intung a om Saul a sam hi. “Thou in, k’on paisakta ding” a chi hi. Huchi in a nih un a paikhia ua, Saul leh Samuel a pawtta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khaw nawl a tunsuk un Samuel in Saul kiang ah, “Sikhapa i malam ah paisak inla, amah a paita a, nang bel khawl tadih in, Pathian thu k’on hilh ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huaikhit in Samuel in sathau bawm a lakhia a, a lu ah asung a, a tawp a, “ Toupa’n a goutante tung a heutu din sathau a honnilh kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuni a n’on nutsiat chiang in Zelzah ah Benjamin gamgi a Rakil han kiang ah mi nih na mu dia; amau na kiang ah, ‘Na sabiltung zonte a muta uh. Ngai in, na pa’n sabiltungte lungkhampih nawnlou in, nang a hon lungkhampihta hi. Ka tapa adin bang ka hihdia, chichi ahi, a chi ding uh’.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai apan pai zel inla, Tabor tawsaw na vatung dia, huai ah mi thum Bethel a Pathian kiang a hohtou dingte’n hon na kituahpih ding uh. Khat in kelnou a pom dia, khat in tanghoupek khal thum a tawi dia, khat in uain thawl a tawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chibai a honbuk ding ua, tanghoupek khal nih a honpe ding ua; huai na la ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaikhit in Philistia sepaihte omna Pathian tang na va tung ding. Hichi ahi ding a, huai khua na va tun chiang in zawlnei pawl khat a ma ua pekgingte, khuangtate, tamngaite leh kaihgingte tawi mi pawl toh munsang apan hong paikhesuk na tuak dia, amaute’n thu a gen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa Kha nakpitak in na tung ah a hongtung ding a, nang leng amau toh thu na gen dia, huchi in mituam na suak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Hiai chiamtehnate na tung a a hongtun chiang in, thil hongom in a zil dungzui in na hih ding ahi. Pathian lah na kiang ah a om ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei ma in Gilgal ah hohsuk in. Ngai in, keileng haltum thillatte leh lemna kithoihnate lan din na kiang ah ka hongsuk ding’. Na kiang a ka hong a, na hih ding k’on hilh ma ni sagih na tam ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchibang a hong hingei a, Samuel paisan dia a nungngat tak in Pathian in lungtang dang a peta hi. Huai chiamtehna tengteng huai ni’n a hongtung vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in tang a hongtun uleh, ngai in, zawlneite’n a na kituahpih uh. A tung ah Toupa Kha nakpitak in a hongtung a, a thugenna uah amah leng a telsamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, tuma siaha amah a na theisate’n zawlneite thugenna ah a telsam chih a theih un, a kihou ua, “Kish tapa tung a thil hongom bangchidan ahita a? Saul leng zawlneite lak a telsamta ahi maw?” a kichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A omna khua ua mi khat in a dawng a, “A pa uh kua ahi tuan a ahia?” a chi hi. Huchi in Saul leng zawlnei ahi samta maw? chih paunak a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thugen khit in munsang a tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Saul pangak in a kiang ah leh a sikha kiang ah, “Kaw hoh na hi ua?” a chi hi. Aman “Sabiltung zong ka hi uh. Ka muh zohlouh ziak un Samuel kiang ah ka vahoh uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul pangak in, “Samuel in na kiang ua bang ahia a gen honhilh dih” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Saul in a pangak kiang ah, “Sabengtungte a muta uh chih a honhilh hi” a chi hi. Himahleh lalgam thu Samuel in a genpen a hilh kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Samuel in mipite Mizpah ah Toupa mai ah a samkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai ah Israel suante kiang ah, “ Toupa , Israelte Pathian in hichi in a chi. Israelte Aigupta apan ka pikhia a, Aigupta mite khut apan leh nou hon nuaisiah gam tengteng apan k’on hunkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh tuni in na mangbatna tengteng uleh na gimthuakna tengteng ua kipan nou hon humbitpa na Pathian uh na deihkei uh. A kiang ah, Ahi kei, kumpipa hon bawlsak in, na chi uh. Huaiziak in, tuin a nam a nam leh a chi a chi in Toupa ma ah hong kilang un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi a Samuel in Israel chi tengteng a hong kilat naisak tak in Benjamin chitel a hong hita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamin chite bel a inkuan kuan in a hong kilak ua, Matri mite inkuan tel a honghi a, Kish tapa Saul tel a hong hita hi. Amah a zon uh leh a muzou kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />huaiziak in, Toupa a dong tuan nawn ua, “Hiai mi hongpai nailou hiam” a chi uh. Toupa’n a dawng a, “Ngai un, vanlak ah a kibu hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in a tai ua, a va pikhia uh. Mipi lak a adin leh mi lak ah a sangpen a, kuamah a liangzang khengzou a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Samuel in mi tengteng kiang ah, “ Toupa miseh na mu uhia? Mi tengteng lak ah amah bang mahmah a omkei uh” a chi hi. Mite a kikou ua, “Pathian in kumpipa hondam hen” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in Samuel in mipite lalgam omdan ding a hilh hi. Laibu ah a gelh a, Toupa ma ah a koih hi. Samuel in mite amau in chiat ah a pai sakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Saul leng Gibeah khua a a in ah a pai sam hi. Pathian in a lungtang uh a khoih mihangsante leng amah toh a paikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Himahleh Belial tapate’n, “Hiai mi’n bangchi’n a hon hondam thei mahmah dia?” chi in amah a ngaineu ua, thilpiak a hong pekei uh. Himahleh amah bel a daidide hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Ammon mi Nahash a hong kisa a, Jabesh-gilead sual tum in a vagiah khum hi. Jabesh mi tengteng in Nahash kiang ah, kou toh thukhun bawl in, huchi in nang na ka sem ding uh, a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ammon mi Nahash in a kiang uah, hichibang in ahi nou toh thu ka khun ding. Na mit taklam tengteng uh khelkhiak vek ahi dia; huai Israel mi tengteng minsiatna dia koih ahi ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jabesh khua upate’n a kiang ah, “Israel gam tengteng a thupawmite ka sawl theihna ding un ni sagih sung hon hungaih in. Hon hondam ding kuamah a omkei leh na kiang ah ka hong paikhe ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in huai thupawmite Saul omna khua Gibeah a hongtung uh. Mite bil a zak in huai thute a gen ua; mite aw suah in a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai in, lou apan Saul bawng hawl in a hongpai hi. Saul in “Bang a chi ua ahia mite a kah uh?” a chi hi. Jabesh khua a mite thugen a hilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai thu a zaktak in Saul tung ah Pathian Kha a hongtung a nakpitak in a hehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in bawngtal nih a la a, a satnen vek hi. Israel gam tengteng ah thupawmite a hawmsak a, “Kuapeuh Saul leh Samuel zui nuamlou peuhmah hiai bawngtal bang a hih ding ahi” a chi hi. Huchi in mipite’n Toupa a lau ua, thukhatsat in a hong kuankheta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bezek ah amaute a sim a, Israel mite nuai thum ahi uh. Judah mite sing thum ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hongpai thupawmite kiang ah, “Jabesh-gilead mite kiang ah, zingchiang in nisat sanlaitak mah in hotkhiak na hi ding uh va chi un” a chi hi. Thupawmite a vahoh ua, Jabesh mite a hilh ua, huchi in a kipak mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Jabesh mite’n “Zingchiang in na kiang uah ka hongpawt khe ding ua, ka tung uah na utut un hihmai un” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hichi a honghi a, a zing in Saul in mipite pawl thum in a koih a, zing ven hunlaitakin a giahmun uah a lut uh. Ammon mite sun nisat sanlai tan in a that uhi. Hichi ahi a, a thahvalte a dalhzak vek ua, nih a omkhawm himhim leng a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipite’n Samuel kiang ah, “Kuate ahia, Saul in i tung uah vai a hawm tel ding maw chi? Huai mite honpi in ka that ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Saul in, “Tuni chitchiat in zaw kuamah that kei un. Tuni in Toupa’n Israelte lak ah hotdamna a bawlta ngal a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in Samuel in mipite kiang ah, “Kisa dih uh, Gilgal ah i hoh ding ua, huai ah lalgam i thaksak nawn ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in mite tengteng Gilgal ah a hohta uh. Saul Gilgal ah Toupa ma ah kumpipa in a bawlta uhi. Huai ah Toupa ma ah lemna kithoihnate a lan uhi. Huchi in huai ah Saul leh Israel mi tengteng a kipak mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Samuel in Israel mi tengteng kiang ah, “Ngai dih ua, ka kiang a na thugen tengteng uh ngaikhia in, na tung uah kumpipa ka bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuin, ngai dih ua, kumpipa in na ma uh a kai hi. Kei zaw tek in ka lu leng a kangta hi. Ngai dih ua, ka tapate na kiang uah a om uh. Ka naupan apan tutan na ma uh k’on pi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hiai ah ka om hi. Toupa ma leh a sathau nilhpa ma ah honsel un. Kua bawngtal ka suh ngei a? Kua sabiltung ahia ka suh ngei? Kua ka khem ngei a? Kua ka hih genthei ngei a? Ka mit tawsak din kua apan in golhna ka la ngei a? K’on din nawn vek ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau, “n’on khem ngeikei. N’on hih genthei ngei sam kei. Kuamah khut apan lak tuak louh leng na la ngeikei” a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman a kiang uah, “Ka khut ah bangmah kilawmlou na mu kei uh, chih tuni in Toupa na lak uah theihpihpa ahi a; a sathaunilhpa a theipihpa ahi” a chi hi. Amau, “Amah a hon theipihpa ahi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Samuel in mite kiang ah, “Mosi leh Aron seppa leh Aigupta apan na pipute uh pikhepa Toupa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in ding kinken unla, Toupa ma ah Toupa’n na tung uh leh na pipute uh tung a thildik a na hihte k’on sutpih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta gam a Jakob a lut nung in, na pipute un Toupa a sam ua, huchi in Toupa’n Mosi leh Aron a sawl hi. Na pipute uh Aigupta gam apan a pi khia a, hiai mun ah a tengsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh, Toupa a Pathian uh a mangngilh uh. Aman Hazor sepaih heutu Sisera khut, Philistia mite khut leh Moab kumpipa khut ah a khong a, amaute’n a dou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa a sam ua, Toupa i lehngatsan ua, Baal leh Ashtaroth na i sep ziak un Toupa tung ah i na khialta uh. Himahleh tuin ka melmate khut apan hon hunkhia inla, huchi in nang na ka sem ding uh, a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n Jerubbaal, Bendan, Jephthah leh Samuel a sawl a, khatlam khatlam a na melmate uh khut apan a hon hunkhia hi. Huchi in bittak in na tengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ammon suante kumpipa Nahash nou dou din a hong kuan chih na theihtak un, ka kiang ah, ‘Ahi kei, kumpi in ka tung uah vaihawm hen’ na chi uh. Toupa Pathian lah na kumpipa uh ahi gige ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in na kumpipa tel uleh nget uh en dih uh, Toupa’n kumpipa a hon bawlsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa laudan na siam ua, a nna nasep ua, a aw na zuih ua, Toupa thupiak na helsan kei ua, nou leh na tung ua vaihawm kumpipa toh Toupa na Pathian uh zuite na hih uleh a hoih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh, Toupa aw zuilou a, Toupa thupiak na helsan uleh na pipute un Toupa khut a thuak mah bang un nou leng na thuak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in ding kinken unla, Toupa’n na mitmuh ua thil thupitak a hih ding en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuni in huit buh a la uh ahi kei maw? ‘Van gingsak ding leh vuah zusak din Toupa ka sam ding. Huchi in kumpipa na nget thu uah Toupa mitmuh a thil na hihkhelh uh a thupidan thei in na mu ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in Samuel in Toupa a sam a, Toupa’n huai ni’n van a gingsaka, vuah a zusak hi. Huchi in mite’n Toupa leh Samuel a lau mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi tengteng in Samuel kiang ah, “Ka sihlouhna ding un, Toupa na Pathian kiang ah na sikhate hon thumsak in. Hiai thil hoihlou tak, kumpipa ka na nget uh, ka gitlouhna tengteng uh behlap ka na hita uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Samuel in mite kiang ah, “Lau kei un, hiai thil gilou tak na hihta uhi. Himahleh Toupa na zuih uh pialsan kei unla, na lungtang tengteng un Toupa na semzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lampial kei un. Manna bei thilte leh nou hon hunkhe theiloute zuikei un; amaute bangmahlou ahi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A min thupitak ziak in Toupa’n a mite a lehngatsan kei dia; Amah mite hidia noute honbawl Toupa kipah lam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huai phet leng ahi kei a, nou adia thum tawp in Toupa tung ah thil ka hihkhial hetkei ding. Himahleh lampi hoih leh dik k’on kawkmuh zaw ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa laudan siam photphot un. Na lungtang tengteng un chihtak tak in amah na sem unla; nou adia a thilhih thupitakte ngaihtuah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Himahleh gilou tak a thil na hihlai lai uleh nou leh na kumpipa uh na mangthang ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul kum sawmthum a hih in vaihawm apan a; Israelte tung ah kum nih vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul in Israelte lak ah mi sang thum a tel hi. Huai teng lak a sang nih Mikmash ah leh Bethel tang ah Saul kiang ah a om uh. Sang khat Benjamin gam a Gibeah ah Jonathan kiang ah a om uh. A dangteng a puanin uah a paisak vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jonathan in Gibeah a om Philistia galvil sepaihte a vasual hi. Huai Philistia mite’n a naza uh. Huchi in Saul in, “Hebru mite’n naza uhen” chi in a gam tengteng ah pengkul a mutsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel tengteng in, Saul in Philistia galvil sepaihte a sual chih leh Israelte’n leng Philistia mite huat in a om uh chih thute a na zata uh. Huchi in mite Saul kiang ah Gilgal ah a ki kaikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Philistia mite Israelte sual din a ki kaikhawm uhi. Kangtalai sing thum, sakol tungtuangmi sang guk, mihing tuipi piau a piaunel zah mahmah a tam ahi uh. Huchi in a kuantou ua, Bethaven suahlam pang ah Mikmash ah panmun a khoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mite’n umbit in a om uh, chih a kitheih un, mite lah a lunghimawh mahmahta ua, mite kawkhuk ah, lounok ah, suangpi pang ah, kulh ah leikawhawm ah a kibuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hebru mi khenkhatte Jordan gal ah Gad leh Gilead gam ah a tai uh. Saul bel Gilgal ah a om lailai a, mite’n ling kawmkawm in amah a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Samuel hunseh bang in ni sagih a tam hi. Himahleh Samuel lah Gilgal ah a hongpai kei hi. Huchi in mite’n a taizak santa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul in, “Haltum thillat ding leh lemna thillat dingte hiai ah ka kiang ah honla un” a chi hi. Huchi in haltum thillat a lan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, haltum thillat a lankhin lel a, ngai in, Samuel a hongtung hi. Amah mu din Saul a kuan hi. Samuel in, “Bang na hih na hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saul in, “Mite’n a hon paimangsan khin ua, nang lah niseh ni’n na hongtungta kei hi. Philistia mite lah Mikmash ah a kikaikhawm uh chih ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ‘Philistia mite’n Gilgal ah hon sualdek dek uhi. Toupa hehpihna lah ka ngen naikei a,’ ka chi hi. Huaiziak in, haltum thillat lanlou thei ka hi kei” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samuel in Saul kiang ah, “Na thilhih a haihuai mahmah hi. Toupa na Pathian thupiak, nang thu a honpiak na zuikei hi. Toupa’n Israelte tung ah na lalna tangtawn a hihkip tum zaw hiven maw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh na lalna a mongta ding. Toupa’n thu a honpiak na zuih louh ziak in Toupa’n amah lungtang bang pu mi a zong a, mite tung a heutu din Toupa’n amah a septa hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuel a thou a, Gilgal apan Benjamin gam a Gibeah ah a hoh touta hi. Saul in a kiang a mi omte a sim a, za guk tak ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Saul leh a tapa Jonathan leh a kiang ua mi omte Benjamin gam a Gibeah ah a om uh. Himahleh Philistia mite’n Mikmash ah panmun a khoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lokmite Philistia mite panmun apan pawl thum a hong kuan uh. Pawl khat in Shual gam a Ophrah lam zuan lampi a zui uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawl khat in Bethhoron lam zuan lampi a zui ua, pawl dang in gamdai zul Zeboim guam lam zuan gamgi lampi a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Philistia mite’n, “Hebru mite’n namsau hiam, tei hiam a bawl kha zenzen ding uh” a chih ziak un Israel gam pumpi ah siksekmi a kimu kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh Israel mi tengteng, michih a leilehna, a suanggal, a heipi, a tupi tat hiam din, Philistiate kiang ah a hohsuk zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh tupite, suanggalte, sikkhutte leh heipite tat hiamna dia sikhat leh chiang mukzumte bawlna ding a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in hichi ahi a, a kidou ni un Saul leh Jonathan kiang a om mite’n namsau hiam, tei hiam a neikei uh. Saul leh a tapa Jonathan in bel a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Philistia galvil sepaihte Mikmash kuam ah a paikheta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, ni khat Saul tapa Jonathan in a galvan tawipa tangval kiang ah, “Kisa dih, gal langkhat Philistia mi galvil sepaihte omna ah i va hoh ding” a chi hi. Himahleh a pa a hilh kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul bel Gibeah gam tawp lampek a Migron a theibuhfai kung nuai ah a om hi. A kiang a om mite za guk ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Shiloh a Toupa siampu Eli tapa Phinehas tapa Ikabod unaupa Ahitub tapa Ahijah siampu puanak silh a om hi. Jonathan a hoh chih mipite’n a theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonathan in Philistia mi galvil sepaihte omna a hoh a tupna guam leh guam kikal ah a langtuak tuak ah suangpi sangtak a om hi. A khat min Bozez ahi a, a khat min Seneh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Suangpi sang khatpen Mikmash zawn mallam a om ahi a, a dang khat pen Gebeah zawn simlam a om ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jonathan in a galvan tawipa tangval kiang ah, “Kisa dih, zeksumlouh sepaihte omna ah i va hoh ding. Toupa’n thil a hon hihsak kha mai hiam. Toupa adin a tam hiam, a tawm hiam a hotdamna ding bangmah dalna a om tuan ngalkei a, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A galvan tawipan a kiang ah, “Na lungsim a om bangtak in hih in. Ngai in, na lungsim bang geih ka lungsim ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Jonathan in, “Kisa in, a kiang uah i va hoh galkah dia, i va kimu sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I kiang a, “Na kiang ua ka hong matan uh na om un, a honchih uleh i mun ah i ding kinken dia, a kiang uah i hohtou kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka kiang lam uah hongtou un, a chih uleh bel i hohtou dia, Toupa’n i khut ah amaute a honpia chih ei adin chiamtehna ahi ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A nih un Philistia mi galvil sepaihte a va kimusak uhi. Philistiate’n “En dih uh, Hebru mite a bukna leihawm apan a hong paikhia uh,” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Galvil sepaihte omna a mite’n Jonathan leh a galvan tawipa, “Hongtou unla, thil banghiam k’on ensak ding uh,” chi in a na sam uhi. Jonathan in a galvan tawipa kiang ah, “Hon zuitou dih. Toupa’n amaute Israelte khut ah a peta hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jonathan a khut leh khe toh pangin a kaltou a, a galvan tawipan a zui hi. Amau bel Jonathan ma ah a puk ua, a ma nung in a galvan tawipan amaute a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jonathan leh a galvan tawipan a thah masak pen uh mi sawmnih vel, lou ching khat, bawngtal nih leilehna chia sung ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Giahmun leh gamlak a mipi tengteng a ling ua; galvil sepaihte leh lokmite leng a lingsam uh. Huan zin a hongling a; huchi in nakpitak a linna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Benjamin gam Gibeah Saul galvil mite’n a en vialvial uhi. Ngai in, mipite zul in a zulkhe zungzung ua, khatlam khatlam ah a kiphu muimui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Saul in a kiang a mipi omte kiang ah, “Tuin kisim unla, kuate ahia kimlou hong ki en dih ua” a chi hi. A hong kisim uh leh ngai in, Jonathan leh a galvan tawipa a na omta kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Saul in Ahijah kiang ah, “Pathian bawm vala dih” a chi hi. Huailai in Pathian bawm Israel suante kiang a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Saul in siampu a houpih laitak in Philistia mite giahmun lam a thawmging a ngaih semsem hi. Saul in siampu kiang ah, “Na khut kaikik in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in Saul leh a kiang a mipi om tengteng a paikhawm ua, kidouna ah a hohta uh. Ngai in, amau leh amau namsau in a na kisattuah ua, huchi in a pumbuai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hiai ban ah tuma lam a Hebru mite huai gam kim apan Philistiate giahmun a amau toh vapaitoute leng Saul leh Jonathan kiang ah om in Israel mite lam ah a hong pang nawnta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in Ephraim tanggam a Israelmi kibu tengteng in Philistia mite a taimang uh chih a naza ua, amau leng kidouna a pangsam in a delhzui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in huai ni’n Toupa’n Israelte a humbitta hi. Bethaven pha in a sual uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huai ni’n Israel mite a mangbang uh. Saul in, “Ka melmate tung a phu ka lakna dia nitaklam a hih masiah kuapeuh in an a nek leh hamsia thuak hen” a chih ziak in. Huchi in kuamah in an himhim a chiam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mipi tengteng gamnuai a vatung ua, lei ah khuaizu a na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mipite gamnuai a vatun un, ngai in, khuaizu a na takkhia hi. Himahleh mipite’n hamsia a lauh ziak un kuamah in khut a sawkin a chiam ngamkei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Himahleh Jonathan in apan mipite hamsiaa a vau lam theilou in; a chiang mongin khuaikhak sun in a neta a, huchi in a mithah a hongchiangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mipi lak a mi khat in a houpih a, “Na pa’n zaw mipite tuni a an ne peuhmah hamsethuak in om hen” chi in a vau bikbek hi. Huchi in mipite a bah uhi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jonathan in, “Ka pa’n mite buaisak lel eive. Enta unla, khuaizu tawmchik ka chep ziak lel a ka mit a hongvak tak dan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mipite’n gallak thil a muh peuhpeuh uh tuni in a utut uh ne thei le uh vakzaw na tel in chia! Huaiziak in, Philistiate tamsem thahlouh loh i hi ve ua” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huai ni’n Mikmash apan Aijalon tan in Philistia mite a dou uh. Huchi in mipite a bah mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mipite’n a gallak thil uh a boh in a boh uh. Belamte, bawngtalte leh bawngnoute a man ua, lei ah a that ua, mipite’n a sisan toh a neta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Ngai in, mipite’n sisan toh ne in Toupa tung ah a khialta uh” chi in Saul a hilh uhi. Aman, “Na talekta uhi; ka ma ah suang lianpi khuk un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Saul in, “Mipi lak ah vakzak vek unla, a kiang uah, michih in a bawng honkai hen. Michih in a belam honkai hen. Hiai ah hong gou in ne hen. A sisan toh ne a Toupa tung a thil hihkhial lou in” vachi un, a chi hi. Huai zan in mi tengteng in amau bawngtal chiat uh a honkai ua, huai ah a gou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Saul in Toupa adin maitam a doh a; huai pen Toupa adia maitam a bawl masak pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Saul in, “Zanchiang in Philistia mite vadou unla, zing khovak tan in i sual ding uh. Kuamah i hawikei ding uh” a chi hi. Amau, “Hoih nasak peuhmah hih in” a chi uh. Siampu in ahihleh “Pathian naih ni” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Saul in Pathian a dong a, “Philistia mite ka vasual diam? Israelte khut ah amaute na pe diam?” a chi hi. Himahleh huai nin a dawng kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Saul in, “Nou mipi heutu tengteng hongnai dih ua. Tuni in a koipen ah ahia i khelh uh theihkhiak tum dih uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Israelte hondam zelpa Toupa a hinlai teng ka tapa Jonathan hilhial in a na hihkhelh leh amah a sih ngeingei ding ahi” a chi hi. Himahleh mipi lak a mi kuamah a dawng himhim a omkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Israel tengteng kiang ah, “Noute a tuam in omkhawm unla, kei leh ka tapa Jonathan a tuam in ka omkhawm ding uh” a chi hi. Mipite’n Saul kiang ah, “Hoih nasak bang in hih in” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Saul in Toupa Israelte Pathian kiang ah, “A diktak hon hihlang in, a chi a, Aisan pen Jonathan leh Saul tung ah a puk a; mipite bel a hul uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Saul in, “Kei leh ka tapa kikal ah aisan un,” a chi hi. Huchi in Jonathan tung ah a puk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Saul in Jonathan kiang ah, “Bang ahia na hih honhilh in” a chi hi. Jonathan in a hilh a, “Ka chiang tawi mong in khuaizu neuchik ka na chiam hi. Ngai in, ka sih ding mah ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Saul in, “Pathian in a hihhih in hih mai hen. Huai sang a thupizaw in leng. Jonathan, na si ngeingei ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mipite’n Saul kiang ah, “Israelte lak a hiai hotdamna thupi mahmah hihpa Jonathan a si dia hia? Si lou hial ding. Toupa a hinlai teng a samzang khat leng lei ah a ke hetkei ding. Tuni in Pathian toh a semkhawm uhi” a chi uh. Mipite’n Jonathan a hondam ua, a sikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Saul in Philistia mite a delhlai a kiksanta a, Philistia mite amau om mun ah a paita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Saul in Israelte tung ah vaihawmna a la a, a ning teng ah a melmate, Moab, Ammon suante, Edom, Zobah kumpipate leh Philistia mite a dou a; a kiheina peuh ah a vualzou zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hangsantak in gal a dou a, Amalekte a zou a, a lokmite khut apan Israelte a honkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Saul tapate bel Jonathan, Jishul leh Malkishua ahi ua, a tanu nihte min hiaite ahi; a upa zaw min Merab ahi a, a naupang zaw min Mikal ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Saul zi min Ahinoam ahi a, amah Ahimaaz tanu ahi. A sepaih heutu min Abner ahi a, amah Saul pangak Ner tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Kish bel Saul pa ahi a. Abner pa Nar bel Abiel tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Saul damsung teng in Philistia mite toh nakpitak in a kidou uhi. Saul in mi hat leh hangsan a muh peuhmah a nuai a sem din a lazel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Samuel in Saul kiang ah, “ Toupa’n a mite tung ah, Israelte tung ah kumpipa dia nang sathau honnilh dia a honsawl ka hi. huaiziak in, tuin Toupa thugen ngaikhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n , Amalek mite’n Israelte tung a a thilhih uh, Aigupta gam apan a hongpawt khiak lai ua lampi a a na dal dan ka theigige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amalekte dou din kuan inla, a thilneih tengteng uh hawi himhim neilou in hihmang vek in. Numei leh pasal, naungek leh nawi nelai, bawngtal leh belam, sangawngsau leh sabiltung tan in that vek in, a chi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in Samuel in mipite a samkhawm a, Telaim khua ah amaute a sim a, sepaih nuai nih leh Judah mi sing khat ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul Amalekte khua a tungsuk a, guam ah a na buk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul in Kente kiang ah, “Hongpawt unla, Amalekte apan kihui khia un. Huchilou in zaw, ka honthat tel kha ding. Nou zaw Israel suan tengteng Aigupta apan a hongpawt khiak lai un nana hehpih ua” a chi hi. Huchi in Kente Amalek mite lak apan a pawtkhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saul in Amalek mite Havilah apan Aigupta gam gei a Shur tan in a dou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amalek mite kumpipa Agag a hingmata, mipi tengteng namsau in a satlum vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh Saul leh mipite’n Agag a hawi ua, belam leh bawngtal hoihhoih, a thauthau, belamnoute, a hoih tengteng a that nuam kei uh. A hoihlou leh a deihlouh peuhmah uh bel a thatvek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa thu Samuel kiang ah a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Saul kumpipa dia ka seh ka kisik hi. Honzui lai hon ki nungngatsan in ka thupiak bang in a hih ngalkei a” a chi hi. Hiai in Samuel a hehsak a, zankhua in Toupa a sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Saul mu din Samuel zing khangpi in a thou a, Karmel ah Saul a hoh hi. Ngai in, huai ah amah theihgigena suang a phut a, a kiknawn a, a pai zel a, Gilgal ah a paisukta, chih Samuel hilh in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Saul kiang Samuel a hongtung a, a kiang ah, “ Toupa’n hon vualzawl hen. Toupa thupiak bang in ka hihta” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samuel in, “Tua belam ham ka bil a honglut leh bawng ham ka zakte bangchidan ahi dia le?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul in, “Amalek mite a hon laksak uh ahi. Toupa na Pathian kiang a kithoihna din mipite’n belam leh bawngtal hoihhoih a hawi uhi. A dang tengteng ahihleh ka thatvek uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Samuel in Saul kiang ah, “Daiin, Toupa’n tu zan a ka kiang a a thugen k’on hilh ding” a chi hi. Aman a kiang ah, “Gen dihve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Samuel in, “Nang ngaih in mi neuchik himah lechin leng, Israel nam heutu dia bawl na hi kei maw? Toupa’n Israelte kumpipa din sathau a hon nilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa’n nang a hon sawlkhia a, Kuan inla, mikhialte, Amalek mite thatvek inla, a manthat sipsip masiah uh dou zel in, a honchi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangdia Toupa thu zuilou a, gallak thilte a boh a na boh a, Toupa mitmuh a thil hoihlou na hih mawk?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Saul in Samuel kiang ah, “E, Toupa thu ka zui vaw oi, Toupa’n honsawlna ah kahoh a, Amalek kumpipa Agag ka honman a, Amalek mite ka that vek vaw oi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh mipite’n gallak thil belam leh bawngtal hihman ding lak ah a hoihhoih Gilgal khua a Toupa na Pathian kiang a kithoihna din a hontawi uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Samuel in, “ Toupa’n Toupa thu zuih a kipahpih bang in haltum thillatte leh kithoihnate a kipahpih ahia? Ngai in, kithoihna sang in thuman a hoihzaw a, belamtal thau sang in a thuman a hoihzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Helna zaw aisan khelhna toh a kibang a, engtatna zaw milim biakna toh a kikim hi. Toupa thu na nial ziak in Aman leng kumpipa din nang a hon nialta hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Saul in Samuel kiang ah, mipite lau a, a thu uh ka manna lam ah Toupa thupiak leh nang thu ka na bohse maizen a; ka na khialta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huaiziak in, tuin ka khelhna ngaidam inla, Toupa ka biak theihna din kei lam ah hong kihei nawn in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Samuel in Saul kiang ah, “ Toupa thu na nialta a, nang lam ah ka hong kiheinawn kei ding. Toupa’n Israelte kumpipa din a hon deihkei” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi in Samuel paidia a kihei leh a puan-mong ah a len a, a kekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in Samuel in a kiang ah, “Tuni apan Toupa’n Israel gam a honsutta, nang sang a hoihzaw na inveng kiang ah a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israelte thagui a zuaukei dia, a kisik sam kei ding. Mihing bang a kisik nawn themthum mi ahi ngal kei hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in aman, “Ka na khialta hi. Himahleh ka mite upate leh Israelte ma a hon zahtak din k’on ngen hi. Toupa na Pathian ka biak theihna din kei lam ah hong kihei in aw” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in Samuel in Saul a paipihta a, Saul in Toupa a bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Samuel in, “Amalek mite kumpipa Agag ka kiang ah honpi un” a chi hi. Samuel kiang ah ling kawm in Agag a vahoh hi. Agag in sihna mulkimhuai in hon paikhengta eive, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Samuel in, “Na namsau in numeite ta neilou dia a bawl bang in na nu leng numei lak a ta neilou mi ahi ding” a chi hi. Huchi in Samuel in Agag Gilgal khua ah Toupa ma ah a satzanta hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huchi in Samuel Ramah khua ah a pai a; Saul bel a inn ah Saul omna khua Gibeah ah a paitouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huchi in Samuel in a sih ni pha in Saul a mu nawnta kei hi. Samuel bel Saul ziak in a lungkham hi. Israelte kumpipa dia Saul a na tel ziak in Toupa a kisik hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Toupa’n Samuel kiang ah, “Israel mite kumpipa dia ka deih louhsa Saul ziak in bang tan ahia na lungkham ding? Na ki ah sathau thundim inla, kuan in. Bethlehem mi Jesse kiang ah k’on sawl ding. A tapate lak a mi kumpipa din ka sepkhinta hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Samuel in, “Bangchi’n ka kuan thei dia? Saul in a naza leh a honthat ding” a chi hi. Toupa’n , “Bawngla pi inla, Toupa kiang a kithoih dia hong ka hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kithoihna ah Jesse sam inla, na hih ding k’on hilh ding. A min k’on hilh dingpa sathau hon nilhsak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Samuel in Toupa gen bang in a hih a, Bethlehem ah a hohta hi. Khua a upate’n ling kawm in amah a na dawn ua, “Hoihlam thu a hong na hi maw?” a chi uh. Aman, “Hoihlam thu ah hi e” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“ Toupa kiang a kithoih dia hong ka hi. Kisiangsak unla kithoihna ah hongpai sam un” a chi hi. Jesse leh a tapate a siangsak a, kithoihna ah a sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a hongpai un Eliab a na en a, “ Toupa sathau nilhpa a ma a ompa ahi mahmah ve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa’n Samuel kiang ah, “A mel in hiam, a sandan in hiam en ken. Ken amah ka deihkei hi. Toupa’n mihing et bang in a enkei. Mihing in pawlam a kilat dan a en a, Toupa’n bel lungtang a enzaw hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesse in Abinadab a sam a, Samuel ma ah a paisak hi. Aman, “Hiai leng Toupa tel ahi naikei” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesse in Shammah a va paisak nawn hi. Aman, “Hiai leng Toupa tel ahi naikei lai” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Jesse in a tapa sagihte Samuel ma ah a paisak nawn hi. Samuel in Jesse kiang ah, “ Toupa’n hiaite a telkei” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samuel in Jesse kiang ah, “Hiai ah na tate a omkim vek uhia?” a chi hi. Aman, “A naupangpen a omlai hi. Ngai in, belam a ching hi” a chi hi. Samuel in Jesse kiang ah, “Va samsak dihve; a hongtun masiah i tu kei ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in a va samsak a, amah a honpi ua. Amah bel san thiuh theuh, mithah kilawm leh melhoih tak ahi. “ Toupa’n , thou inla, sathau nilh in, hiai amah ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samuel in sathau bawm ki a la a, a unaute lak ah amah sathau a nilh hi. Toupa Kha huai ni apan nakpitak in David tung ah a hongtungta. Samuel a thou a, Ramah khua ah a paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh, Toupa Kha in Saul a pawtsan a, Toupa sawl dawi in amah a hihbuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul sikhate’n a kiang ah, “Ngai in, Pathian sawl dawi in nang a hon hihbuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka toupa un na ma a om na sikhate kaihging tumsiam tak mizon thu honpe dihve. Pathian sawl dawi in a honmat chiang in a tum dia, na hoih mai ding” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saul in a sikhate kiang ah, “Tumsiam tak mi hon zonsak unla, ka kiang ah honpi un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A sikhate lak a khat in a dawng a, a kiang ah, “Ngai dih, Bethlehem mi Jesse tapa khat ka muta a, huai mi tumsiam tak, mi hangsan tak, kidou mi, thugen siam, melhoih tak ahi a, a kiang ah Toupa a om hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saul in Jesse kiang ah mi a sawl a, “Na tapa David belamchinga om ka kiang ah hon hohsak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesse in sabiltung, tanghou leh uain thawl khat leh kelnou a la a, Saul piak din a tapa David a pawsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul kiang ah David a vatung a, a ma ah a vading hi. Aman a na it mahmah a, a galvan tawipa in a pangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Saul in Jesse kiang ah, “David ka kiang ah om hen, ka mit a tung mahmah hi” chi a hilh din mi sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hichi ahi a Pathian sawl dawi Saul tung a a hongom chiang in David in kaihging a la a, a tumzel hi. Huchi in Saul a honghalh a, a hoih a; dawi in a pawtsan hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Philistia mite’n kidou din a sepaihte uh a kaikhawm ua, Judah gamsung Soko khua ah a kikhawm uhi. Ephes Dammim mun ah Soko khua leh Azekah khaw kikal ah panmun a khoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul leh Israel mite a kikhawm ua, Ela guam ah panmun a khoh uh. Philistia mite na dal din a kiphalh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Philistia mite tang pang ah a om ua, Israel mite bel a langkhat tang pang ah a om ua, a kikal uah guam a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Philistia mite panmun apan a mi hat uh, a min Goliath, Gath khaw mi, tong guk leh khap khat a sang a hong pawtkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dal lukhu a khu a, awmphaw a silh a; a awmphaw gikdan dal sekel sang nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ngal ah dal ngalphaw a bun a, a nungzang ah dal teita a kuah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tei peu siamkol bang ahi a; a tei lu bel sik sekel za guk a gik ahi. A phaw pawpa a ma ah a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ding a, Israel sepaihte a sam a, a kiang uah, Bangdia kidou dia hong kiphalh na hi ua? Kei Philistia mi, nou Saul sikha na hi kei uh maw? Mi kitel unla ka kiang ah hong paisuk hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hon sual a a honthah leh na sikha un ka om ding uh. Himahleh ken ka zoh a ka thah leh ka sikha un na om ding ua, ka na uh na sem ding uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Philistia mi in, Tuni in Israel sepaihte ka tou a, mi khat hon kuansak unla ka na kisual ding uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saul leh Israel tengteng in huai Philistia mi thugente a zak un, a lunglel ua, lauh petmah in a lauta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />David Jesse tapa ahi a, amah bel Judah gam a Bethlehem, Ephrath mi ahi a, tapa giat a nei hi. Amah Saul hunlai in tektak ahi khin a, tektak a ngaih ahi khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesse tapa upa zaw thum in kidouna ah Saul a zui uhi. A tapa thum kidouna a hohte min a upapen Eliab, a zom Abinadab, a thumna Shammah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David a naupangpen ahi a, a u thumte’n Saul a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David, Bethlehem ah a pa belam kem in Saul kiang apan a vahoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Philistia mi in zingsang leh nitak teng in a va naihzel a, ni sawmli sung a va kitaklang zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesse in a tapa David kiang ah, “Vaimim kan ephah khat leh hiai tanghou beu sawm pua inla, na unaute kiang ah a giahmun uah va hohpih pah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawngnawi dat khal sawm a pawl ua sang heutupa adin puak inla; na unaute bangchi’n a om ua va en inla, a tanchin uh theihna banghiam hon pua in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saul leh amau leh Israel mi tengteng Philistia mite dou din Elah guam ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />David zingkhang in a thou a, belamte chingmi khat a kemsak hi. Jesse in thu a piak dungzui in a pua a, a kuanta hi. Kidouna mun a pawtkhe lel sepaihte kidou dia a kikou zuazua laitak un amah kangtalai omna mun a va tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israelte leh Philistia mite kidou din a na kikhung ua, sepaih leh sepaih a na ki galsai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in a kemmi khut ah a van a koih a, sepaihte kiang lam ah a vatai a, a ute chibai a vabuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amaute a houpih laitak in ngai in, a mi hat uh Gath khua a Philistia mi a min Goliath Philistia mite sepaih pawl lak apan a hong paisuk a, a thugen ngeimah a hong gennawn hi. Huai thu David in a zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel mi tengteng in huai mi a muh un, a taikek ua, lauh petmah in a lau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel mite’n, “Huai mihing hong kuan khia na mu hia? Israel mite tou dia hong kuan khia ahi. Kuapeuh amah that kumpipa’n nakpitak in sum lam in a hih hausa dia, a tanu a pedia, a pa inkuan Israelte lak ah a zalen sak ding” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />David in a kiang a dingte kiang ah, “Hiai Philistia mi that a, Israelte minsiatna lamang mi bangchi bawl ahi dia? Hiai zeksumlouh Philistia mi kua ahia a hih, Pathian hing sepaihte a touvial mahmah” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mipite’n huchi in a dawng ua, “Amah that peuhmah ka gen bang ua bawl ahi ding” a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A u upapen Eliab in mite kiang a, a thugen lai a naza hi. David tung ah Eliab a heh guih a, “Bangdia hongsuk na hia? Gamdai a belam tamlou omte kua chingsak na hia? Na kisaktheihdan leh na lungsim hoihlouh dan ka thei. Kidou en ding bang in na hong mawkmawk a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />David in “Bang ka hih a ahia? A ziak om hilou ahi maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aman midang lam a ngatsan a, a gen ngeimah a gen hi. Mipite’n a ma amah bang in a dawng nawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />David thugen a zak un Saul kiang ah a gensawn ua; aman a sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David in Saul kiang ah, “Amah ziak in kuamah lungsim lunglel kei heh. Na sikha in huai Philistia mi ka vasual ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Saul in David kiang ah, “Nang zaw huai Philistia mi sual din na kuan theikei ding, valnou phet na hi ngal a. Amah lah a valnou tung apan galdou siammi ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />David in Saul kiang ah, “Na sikha in a pa belamte a chinlai in, humpinelkai hiam vompi hiam a hong kuan a, belamhon lak apan belamnou a man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka delhzui a, ka sual a, a kam apan ka hunkhe zel hi. Amah hongsual tum in a hong ding a, ken a baksam ah ka man a, ka sual a, ka that zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na sikha in humpinelkai leh vompi ka that tuaktuak hi. Huai zeksumlouh Philistia mi amau bang in a omsam ding hi. Pathian hing sepaihte a touvial a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />David in, “Humpinelkai khutbom apan leh vompi khutbom apan kei hon hunkhepa Toupa’n huai Philistia mi khut apan a hon hunkhe ding” a chi hi. Saul in David kiang ah, “Kuan in, na kiang ah Toupa om hen!” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Saul in amah galthuam David a silhsak a, dal lukhu a khusak a, awmphaw a silhsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />David in a galvan tung ah a namsau a kuah a, pai din a kisa hi. Huchibang a chiamteh ngei naikei hi. David in Saul kiang ah, “Ka paipih theikei. Hichibang ka chiamteh ngeikei” a chi hi. Huchi in David in a galthuam a suahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A chiang a tawi a, luita a suang mum mam pilhpelh nga a tel hi. A belamchinna ip, a kawlzal ah a kuah hi. A vaisuanglot a tawi a, Philistia mi a vazuan naita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Philistia mi a hongpai zel a, David a zuan nai hulhul a; a lum tawipa a ma ah a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Philistia min a en vialvial a, David a muh leh a simmawh mahmah hi. Amah lah san chiuchiau, mithah kilawm tak, valnou lel lah ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Philistia mi in David kiang ah, “Ui ka hi maw chiangte toh ka kiang a na hongpai?” a chi hi. Philistia mi in a pathiante lou in David a hamsiat khumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Philistia mi in David kiang ah, “Ka kiang ah hongpai in, na sa tung a leng vasate leh gamsate ka nesak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />David in Philistia mi kiang ah, “Nang zaw namsau, tei leh teita tawi in n’ong kuan hi. ‘Kei zaw sepaihte Toupa , Israel sepaihte Pathian ka Toupa min in ka hong kuan zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuni in Toupa’n ka khut ah nang a honpe ding hi. Huchi in ka honthat dia, na lutang ka tan ding. Philistia sepaihte luangte tuni’n tung a leng vasate leh gamsate ka nesak ding hi’. Huchi in, leitung a mi tengteng in Israel ah Pathian a om chih a thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hiai a kikhawm tengteng in Toupa’n namsau leh tei in a hondam kei chih a thei ding uh. Kidouna lah Toupa kidouna ahi ngal a. Aman ka khut uah noute a honpe ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Philistia mi a hong kuan a, David sual dia a honnaih leh David sepaihte lam ah Philistia mi sual din a tai gepgep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />David in a ip a sawk a, suang khat a lakhia a, a vaisuanglot in a lawn a, Philistia mi taltang tak ah a deng hi. A taltang ah suang a lut a, a khup in a puk helhul maimah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Huchi in David in vaisuanglot leh suang in Philistia mi a zou hi. Philistia mi a deng a, a thatta hi. Himahleh David in namsau a tawi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Huaiziak in, David a tai a, Philistia mi tung ah ading hi. A namsau a la a, a pai apan a dokkhia a, huai in a that a, a lu a tanta hi. Philistia mite’n a mi hat uh a sita, chih a theih un a taikekta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Israel mite leh Judah mite a thou ua, a kikou ua, Philistia mite Gath leh Ekron kulh kongkhak pha in a delh uh. Philistia mite lak a liamte Shaaraim lam tawn in Gath leh Ekron pha in a puk zengzung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Israel suante’n Philistia mite a delh uh a tawpsan ua, a hong kiknawn ua, a giahmun uh a lok uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />David in Philistia mi lu a la a, Jerusalem ah a paipih a, a galvan bel a puanin ah a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Saul in Philistia mi sual dia David kuan a muh in sepaih heutu Abner kiang ah, “Abner, hiai valnou kua tapa ahia?” a chi hi. Abner in “Na hinna lou in ka gen, toupa aw, ka theikei,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Kumpipa’n “Hiai naupang kua tapa hiam dongkhia in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Philistia mi that David a hongpai in Abner in a pi a, Philistia mi lu tawikawm in Saul kiang ah a paipih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Saul in a kiang ah, “Tangval, kua tapa na hia?” a chi hi. David in a dawng a, “Bethlehem mi na sikha Jesse tapa ka hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, Saul kiang a thu a gen khit in Jonathan hinna leh David hinna a hong kipeh geih a, huchi in Jonathan in amah hinna a it bang in amah a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul in huai nin a omsak ngal a, a pa inn ah a paisak nawnta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in Jonathan leh David in thu a khung ua, amah hinna bang geih a amah a it ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonathan in a puansilhlai a suah a, David a pia a, a kivatna leh a namsau leh a thalpeu leh a taigakna nangawn a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul in a sawlna peuh ah David a hohzel a, kizentak in a gamtang hi. Saul in sepaihte heutu in amah a bawl a, huai mi tengteng ngaih in leh Saul sikhate ngaih in a hoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hongpai un hichi ahi a, Philistia mi that David a hongpai in Israel khaw teng ah numeite lasa leh lam kawm in khuangta leh thilging theite toh, nuamsatak in kumpipa Saul dawn din a hong pawtkhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Numeite’n lam kawm a la a kidawng tuah in, “Saul in asang asang a that, David in asing asing” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiai lasak in Saul a kipaksak kei a, a heh mahmah hi. David bel asing asing thatin a ngai ua, kei ka hihleh asang asang kia thatin a hon ngai uh. Gam lou ngal a tanding dang bang ahia omta? a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul in huai ni apan David a hazat bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a zingsang in Saul tung ah Pathian sawl dawi a hongtung a, inn sung ah thu a gen hi. David in nidang a a hih mah bang in kaihging a tum hi. Saul in a teipi a tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saul in a teipi a khoh a, huai bang ah David ka khohden ding, a chi hi. David in nihvei a kihep khiaksan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kiang a Toupa a om ziak leh Saul a paisan ziak in Saul in David a lau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Saul in amah apan a kisuansak a, a sepaih sang tung a heutu in a bawl hi. Huchi in David mipi lak ah lut in a pawt zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David bel a hih peuhmah ah piltak in a gamtang zel a; Toupa a kiang ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul in piltak in a gamtang chih a muh in a lau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh Israelte leh Judahte tengteng in David a it ua; a lak ua lut a pawt zel lah ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saul in David kiang ah, “Ngai in, ka tanu upa zaw Merab na zi din k’on neisak ding. Hangtak in hon gum peuhmah lechin. Toupa kidounate dou in” a chi hi. Saul in, “Ken zaw a tung a khut khalou in Philistia mite’n a tung ah khut kha zaw uhen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />David in Saul kiang ah, “Kua ahia ka hih a, ka hinna leh Israelte lak a ka pa inkuante leng bang ahia a hih uh, kumpipa makpa ka hihna ding?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh hichi ahi a, Saul tanu Merab David toh kitensak a hong hun in Meholath mi Adriel zi din a pe mawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Saul tanu Mikal in David a it a; Saul a hilh ua; huai in a kipaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul in, “A awkna ding thang a hong hih theihna ding leh Philistia mite’n a tung a khut a khak theihna ding un amah ka pe ding” a chi hi. Huaiziak in, Saul in David kiang ah, “Tuni’n ka makpa na hihna ding hunlem a nihveina na nei” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in Saul in a sikhate thu a pia a, “A simtham in David houpih unla, ngai in, kumpipa na tung ah a kipak mahmah a, a sikhate tengteng in leng nang a hon it uh. Huchi in kumpipa makpa in om in” chi un, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Saul sikhate’n huai thu David bil ah a gen uh. David in, “Mi genthei leh kuamah theihphak ngellouh kei adin kumpipa makpa hih thil namai in na sep ua hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Saul sikhate’n, “David in huchibang in a chi” chi’n a hilh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saul in David kiang ah hichibang in na chi ding uh, “Kumpipa’n kumpipa melma phulakna din Philistia mite zekvun za khat chihlouh man bangmah a deihkei a chi” chi un, a chi hi. Saul in David lah Philistia mite khut a sihsak lungsim in a nei bikbek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A sikhate’n huai thu David a hilh uleh kumpipa makpa hih David a kipak mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi in ni chiamte a beima in, David leh a mite a thou ua, Philistia mite za nih a va that uh. David in a zekvun uh a honpua a, kumpipa makpa a hih theihna din kumpipa kimtakin a pia hi. Huchi in Saul in a tanu Mikal a zi din a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Saul in David kiang ah Pathian a om chih a theitelta hi. Saul tanu Mikal in amah a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in Saul in David a lau semsem a, Saul bel David melma ahi denta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Philistia miliante a va kuankhe zel uh. Hichi ahi a, a kuan khiak peuhmah chiang un David bel Saul sikha tengteng sang a piltak a a gamtat ziak in a min a thang semsem hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Saul in a tapa Jonathan leh a sikha tengteng kiang ah David that un, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Himahleh Saul tapa Jonathan in David a deihthoh mahmah hi. Jonathan in, “Ka pa Saul in thah din hon zong hi, huaiziak in, zingchiang in zingsang in pilvang inla mun guk ah bu nilouh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka pawtkhe dia, na omna gamlak ah ka pa kiang ah ka va ding dia, na tungtang thu ah ka pa ka houpih ding. Huchi in ka theih k’on hilh ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonathan in a pa Saul ma ah David a phat a, a kiang ah, “Kumpipa a sikha David tung ah khial hetkei hen. Na tung ah lah a khial kei a, a thilhihte lah nang adia hoih pipi ahizaw ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sih khawksalou in Philistia mi a sual a, Toupa’n Israel tengteng adin hotdamna thupitak a sep khiaksak hi. Huai nangngei in na mu a, na kipak mahmah hi. Huaiziak in, sisan poikhoihlou tung ah bang ding in ahia na khelh ding, a ziak bangmah omlou a David na thah ding?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Saul in Jonathan thugen a zui hi. Saul in kichiam in, “ Toupa a hin laiteng amah thah ahi kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jonathan in David a sam a, huai thil tengteng a hilh hi. Jonathan in David Saul kiang ah a pi a, tuma lam mah bang in a kiang ah a om nawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kidouna a hongom nawn a, David a kuan khia hi. Philistia mite a vasual a, tamtak a vathat a, a ma ah a taikek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul bel a inn a teipi tawi a, a tutlai in Toupa sawl dawi a tung ah a hongtung hi. David in kaihging a tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul in a teipi in David bang toh khohden a tum hi. Himahleh Saul kiang apan a kitholh khegeih a, teipi pen bang ah a khohtal hi. Huchi in David a taikhia a, huai zan in a suakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saul in a zingsang a David tang a that ding in mi a sawl hi. David zi Mikal in, tu zan a na hinna na humbit kei leh zingchiang in a honthat ding uh, chi in a hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mikal in David tohlet ah a khai khesuk a; huchi in a taimang a, a suakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mikal in milim a la a, lupna ah a lumsak a, a lu lam ah kelmul lukham a koih a, puan in a khuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David pi dia Saul in mi a honsawl kiang ah, “A chi a na” a na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul in David va en din mi a sawl nawn a, “A lupna toh hon zawngtou le uchin ka na that ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A mi sawlte a va lut uleh, ngai in, lupna ah milim a lu lam a kelmul lukham kham in a na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saul in Mikal kiang ah, “Bangdia hichibang a hon zekhem a, bitna dia ka melma pawtsak na hia?” a chi hi. Mikal in Saul a dawng a, “Hon paisak in, bangdia nang honthat ding ka hia?” a honchi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in David a taimang a, a suakta hi. Ramah khua a Samuel kiang a va tung a, Saul in a tung a a thilhih tengteng a va hilh hi. Amah leh Samuel a kuan ua, Naioth ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai in, Ramah khua a Naioth ah David a om, chi in Saul a hilh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in David pi din Saul in mi a sawl hi. Zawlnei pawlte lasak lai leh Samuel a tung ua heutu a om a vamuh un Saul in a mi sawlte tung ah Pathian Kha a hongtung a, amau leng la a sata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huai Saul a hilh uleh, midang a sawl nawn a, amau leng la a vasa sam uh. Saul in a thumveina din mi a sawl nawn a, amau leng la a vasa sam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amah leng Ramah khua ah a va hoh a, Seku mun a tuileh lian mahmah a va pha hi. “Samuel leh David koi a om ahi ua?” chi in a dong hi. Mi kuahiam khat in, “Ngai in, Ramah khua a Naioth ah a om uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ramah khua a Naioth ah a hoh a; Pathian kha a tung ah a hongtung samta a, a pai zel hi. Ramah khua a Naioth a tun tan in la a sazel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aman a puansilhte leng a suahsam a, Samuel ma ah la a sa a, huai ni nitum leh huai zankhua in vuaktang in a lum hi. Huaiziak in, “Saul leng zawlnei lak a telsam ahi maw?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, David bel Ramah khua a Naioth apan a tai a, Jonathan kiang a vatung hi. “Bang ka hih a ahia? Bang ahia ka tatsiatna? Na pa tung ah bang ahia ka hihkhelh, hichitak a honthah a tup maizen?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman, “That lou e. Na si hetkei ding. Ngai in, ka pa’n kei hon theisak lou in bangmah himhim lian in neuta leh, a hih ngeikei hi. Bang ding in ahia hiai thute kei a honim ding? A honim kei hial ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David in, “Na pa’n lah n’on hehpih dan a thei mahmah ngal a. Jonathan in hiai zaw thei dah hen, huchilou in zaw a lungkham lua kha ding chi ahi ding. Himahleh Toupa hinna leh na hinna lou in ka gen ahi, sihna toh ka kikal uh kal khat lel ahi” chi in uangtakin a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonathan in David kiang ah, “Na hinna in a deih peuhpeuh k’on hihsak zel ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David in Jonathan kiang ah, “Ngai in, zingchiang a kha thak ding ahi. Kumpipa kiang a Ankuang um ngeingei ding ka hi. Himahleh a ni thum ni nitaklam tanpha in gamlak a kibu din ka kuan zaw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na pa’n ka omlouh a hon theihkhiak leh, David in a khua Bethlehem a va hohzual a hon ngen ngutngut a; a inkuan ua dia a kum teng a a kithoih hun uh ahi” na chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“A hoih vo oi, a chih leh na sikha a lungmuang ding. Himahleh a heh leh thil hoihlou hih a tum, chih theimai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaiziak in, na sikha hoihtak in hih in. Na sikha lah Toupa thukhun ah na lutpihta ngal a. Himahleh tatsiatna nei ka hihleh nangmah in honthat mai in. Bangdia na pa kiang a honpi chitchiat ding na hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jonathan in, “Thatlou e. Ka pa’n na tung a thil hoihlou hih a tum chih ka theih peuhmah leh nang hilhlou in ka om mahmah dia hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in David in Jonathan kiang ah, “Na pa’n hehngawh in hon na dawngta leh kuan a honhilh dia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jonathan in David kiang ah, “Paidih, gamlak ah i va hoh peuhmah ding” a chi hi. Huchi in gamlak ah a va hoh khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jonathan in David kiang ah “ Toupa Israelte Pathian a theipa hi hen. Zingchiang hichih hun hiam, ni thum ni hiam a ka pa ka vadawp hun a, ngai in, David tungtang thu a hoihlam ahihleh na kiang a mi honsawl in ka honghilh kei dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka pa’n na tung ah thil hoihlou hih ut bang hita leh, k’on hilhlouh a, lungmuangtak a na pai theihna dia k’on khahkei leh, Toupa’n Jonathan a bawlbawl in bawl henla, huai sang a thupi in leng. Ka pa kiang a a om zel bang in Toupa na kiang ah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka sih louhna dia ka damsung kia a Toupa hehpihna hon musak hilou in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tangtawn in ka inkawte leng na hehpih tawp ken. Toupa’n David melma leitung apan a hih mankhit vekpha in leng tawp ken” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jonathan in David inkawte toh thukhun bawl in “David melmate khut tan in leng Toupa’n phut hen,” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Jonathan in David a kichiamsak nawn hi. Amah hinna a it bang geih in lah a it ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in Jonathan in a kiang ah, “Zingchiang a kha thak ding ahi. Na tutna a vuak ding ziak in na omlouh a kilang ngei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni thum na om nung in paisuk pah inla, tuma a thil a hong omlai a na kibukna mun ah hoh inla, Ezel suang chin ah a na om gige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Muitum bang in thaltang thum a sik ah k’on kapkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngai in, kuan inla, thaltangte va mukhia in, chi in naupang ka sawl ding. Naupang kiang a, En in, thaltangte na nunglam ah a om, la inla hongpai in, ka chih leh Toupa hinna lou in ka gen hi, nang adin a galmuanhuai in lauh ding omlou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Himahleh naupang kiang a, en in, thaltangte na pamlam ah a om uh, ka chih leh paimang mai in. Toupa’n a hon paimang sak ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nang leh ken thil i gensa tungthu ah ngai in, nang toh i kikal ah Toupa a om tawntung hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in David gamlak ah a kibu a; kha a hong thak a, kumpipa Ankuang um in a tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hun dang a a tutna ngei bang in a tutna ah kumpipa a tu hi. Jonathan ading a, Saul kiang ah Abner a tu a; David mun bel a vuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Himahleh Saul in huai ni’n bangmah a gen kei. “A tung ah thil banghiam a om a, sianglou hiam ahi ding, a sianglou ahi ngei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, khadet zing a ni nih ni’n David mun a vuaklai lai hi. Huchi in Saul in a tapa Jonathan kiang ah, “Bang achia Jesse tapa zan leh tuni a Ankuang um dia hong pailou ahia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jonathan in Saul a dawng a, “David in Bethlehem a hoh a honngen ngutngut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hon hohsak teitei in, ka inkawte’n khua ah kithoihna nei din a hon thukhak chinten uh. Huchi in n’on hehpih theih leh hon hohsak inla, ka unaute ka vaveh ding, a chi hi. Huaiziak in, kumpipa dohkan ah a hong kei hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in Jonathan tung ah Saul a heh guih a, a kiang ah, “Nang, numei genhak leh paupeng tapa, Jesse tapa na zahlakna ding leh na nu vuaktanna zahlak sak din na tel chih theilou honsa na hi hiam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesse tapa hia a omsung teng hihkip na hi kei dia, na gam leng. Huaiziak in, samsak pah inla, ka kiang ah hon pisak in, a sih ngeingei ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jonathan in a pa Saul a dawng a, a kiang ah, “Bang ding in maw thah ding a hih? Bang a hih a ahia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Saul in thahtum in teipi in a khoh a, huchi in Jonathan in apan David thah a tum ngei, chih a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jonathan bel dohkan apan heh mahmah kawm in ading a, huai kha ni nih ni’n an a um sam kei hi. Apan David a zahlak sak mahmah ziak in a lungkham pih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, zingsang in Jonathan in naupang khat pi in gamlak ah David toh a mun sehsa uah a hoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A naupang kiang ah, “Tai inla, ka thaltang kap khiatte va zong in” a chi hi. Naupang a tailai in, a pam lam ah thaltang a kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Naupang, Jonathan in a kapkiakna mun a va tun in Jonathan in naupang a sam a, “Thaltang na pamlam ah ahi kei maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jonathan in a naupang a sam a, “Hong paimeng in, kin in, zekai ken” a chi hi. Jonathan naupang in thaltangte a tawm khawm a, a pu kiang ah a hong paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Himahleh, naupang in bangmah a theikei, Jonathan leh David kia in thil omdan a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jonathan in a naupang kiang ah a thal leh a vante a pia a, a kiang ah, “Pai inla, khua ah nana paipih in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jonathan in a paitakin David a omna mun simlam pang apan ading a, a mai a leisi in thumvei a kunsuk a, a kitawp tuah ua, a kikah khum ua, David a nak kahzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jonathan in David kiang ah, “Lungmuangtakin pai in aw, nang toh kei kikal ah leh ka suante leh na suante kikal ah tangtawn in Toupa om hen” chi’n Toupa min in i kichiam tuak khinta hi” a chi hi. Huchi in ading a, a paita a, Jonathan bel khua ah a lutta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David bel Nob khua a siampu Ahimelek kiang ah a honghi. Ahimelek in ling kawm in David a na dawn a, a kiang ah, “Bangchidan ahia tangtat na chia, kuamah tonpih na neih louh?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in siampu Ahimelek kiang ah, “Kumpipa’n thilhih din thu a honpia a, ka kiang ah, k’on thil hihsak tup leh k’on thupiak kuamah in theikei heh, a chi bikbek hi. Ka sikhate a mun ding uh ka sehsakta” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuin “Na khut ah bang a om a? Tanghou beu nga ahihkeileh na neih lamlam honpia in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siampu in David a dawng a, “Tanghou vantang ka neikei a, himahleh tanghou siangthou bel ka nei hi, tangvalte numei apan a ki hepkhiak nak uleh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David in siampu a dawng a, a kiang ah, “Tu ni thum sung numei apan ka kihem khevek taktak uhi. Ka hong pawtkhiak deklai in leng tangvalte tuium-belsuan a siangthou a, tanghou leng vantang ahi a, ahi, tu ni tuium-belsuan sung a siansak mah bang in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in siampu in tanghou siangthou a peta. Huai ah lah tanghou koih a lak ni ua tanghou lum a khen dia Toupa ma apan lak pen kia loungal tanghou dang a om ngal kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huai ni’n Saul sikhate lak a mi khat Toupa ma a zekai sak a om a; a min Doeg ahi. Amah Edom mi, Saul ganchingmi lak a heutu pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David in Ahimelek kiang ah, “Teipi hiam, namsau hiam na kem kei maw? Kumpipa honsawlna thukin a hih ziak in ka namsau leh ka galvan bangmah ka hontawi mankei hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siampu in, “Philistia mi Goliath, Elah guam a na thahpa namsau, ngai in, siampu puanak nung ah puan a tuam in a om hi. Huai na laknop leh la in. Huai loungal a dang a omkei” a chi hi. David in, “Huai val a om ding hia, honpe dihve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in David ading a, huai ni’n Saul lau in a taimang a, Gath kumpipa Akish kiang ah a paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Akish sikhate’n a kiang ah, “Hiai mi huai gam kumpipa David ahi kei maw? Saul in asang asang a that, David in asing asing, chih loukawm in a tungtang la in a sa zuazua uh ahi kei maw?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />David in huai thute a lungsim in a pai a, Gath kumpipa Akish a lau mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in a ma ah a omdan a hihlamdang a, a mitmuh un a kihai sak hi. A khut in kongkhakte a ham ekek a, a khamul ah a chil a luangsak zungzung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in Akish in a sikhate kiang ah, “Enta unla, mihai a hihna thei ua, bangdia ka kiang a honpi na hi ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihai ka kitaksap ziak in hia hiai mi a haidan hihlang dia ka ma a na honpi uh? Hiai mi ka inn ah a honglut tel mahmah ding maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in David bel huai apan a pawtkhia a, Adullam kawkhuk ah a omta hi. A unaute leh a pate inkawte tengteng in a zak un huai ah a kiang ah a hohsuk uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lungkham peuhmah, leiba nei peuhmah leh lungkimlou peuhmahte a kiang ah a ki kaikhawm uh. Huchi in, a heutu un a omta hi. A kiang ah mi za li hiam tak a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David bel huai apan Moab gam a Mizpah ah a hoh hi. Moab kumpipa kiang ah, “Pathian in a hon hihsak ding thil ka theih masiah ka nu leh ka pate na kiang ah na om le uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab kumpipa ma ah amau a pi a; huchi in kawkhuk a David a omlai teng a kiang ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zawlnei Gad in David kiang ah, “Kawkhuk ah om nilouh ken. Pawt inla Judah gam ah pai in” a chi hi. Huchi in David a pawt a, Hareth gammang ah a lutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul in “David leh a kiang a omte a muta uh” chih a naza hi. Saul bel Gibeah a Ramah khua a tamarisk sing nuai ah teipi tawi in a tu hi. A kim ah a sikha tengteng ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saul in a kim ading a sikhate kiang ah, “Nou Benjamin mite aw, ngaikhia un; Jesse tapa in loute leh grephuante honpia in a sepaih sang heutu leh a sepaih za heutu in a honbawl dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na vek un n’on sawm ua, ka tapa in Jesse tapa kiang a thu a khun ka kiang a hihlang himhim na omkei uh. Ka tapa in ka sikha kei hondou ding leh tuni nasan a kei hon tang dia a hanthawn thu ka kiang a hihlang na omlouh uh?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in Saul sikhate kiang a ding Edom mi Doeg in a dawng a, “Jesse tapa Nob khua a Ahitub tapa Ahimelek kiang a, a hong ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman Toupa a dotsaka, nek ding a pia a, Philistia mi Goliath namsau leng a pelai hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n Ahitub tapa Ahimelek leh Nod khua a siampu a pang a pa inkawte tengteng a samsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Saul in, “Nang, Ahitub tapa, na ngaikhia in” a chi hi. Aman, “Ka toupa, hiai ah ka om” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Saul in a kiang ah, “Tanghou leh namsau na pia a, Toupa bang dotsaka, tuni a kei hondou ding leh hontang dia bang ding a nang leh Jesse tapa in hon guksawm na hi ua?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahimelek in kumpipa a dawng a, “Kumpipa makpa, na thumang, na inkuan sung ua mi zahtakhuai David bang a muanhuai na sikhate tengteng lak ah kua a om ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amah adia Pathian thu ka dotsak a masapen ahi ahia? Ahi kei. Kumpipa’n a sikha hiam, ka pa inkawte kuapeuh hon ngoh mahmah kei hen. Na sikha in hiai thu bangmah ka theikei hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa’n, “Ahimelek, na si ngeingei ding ahi, nang leh na pa inkawte tengteng toh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a kiang a ding sepaihte kiang ah, “Kihei unla, Toupa siampute that un, David lam a apan ua, a taimang chih thei napi a ka kiang a a genlouh ziak un” a chi hi. Himahleh kumpipa sikhate’n Toupa siampute sual ding in khut a zak nuam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Doeg kiang ah, “Nang kihei inla, siampute sual in” a chi hi. Edom mi Doeg a kihei a, siampute a sual a, huai ni’n puanmalngat siampu puanak silh, mi sawmgiat leh nga a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nob, siampu khua namsau in a sual a; numei leh pasal naupang leh nawi nelaite na ngawn, bawngte, sabiltungte leh belamte toh namsau in a satlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahitub tapa Ahimelek tapate lak a khat, a min Abiathar a tai khia a, David kiang ah a taitung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abiathar in Saul in Toupa siampute a thah thu David a hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in Abiathar kiang ah, “Edom mi Doeg huai a, a omni mah in Saul a hilh ngeingei ding chih theisa in ka om hi. Na pa inkuan tengteng kei ziak a si ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nang ka kiang ah om inla, lau ken. Kei thah hon tumte’n nang leng thah a hontum ding uh. Ka kiang ah om lechin na bit ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, ngai in, “Philistia mite’n Keilah khua a sual ua, phual a buhte a laksak vek uh” chi in David a hilh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in David in, “ Toupa , huai Philistia mite ka vasual diam?” chi in a dong hi. Toupa’n David kiang ah, “Philistia mite vasual inla, Keilah khua va humbit in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David mite’n a kiang ah, “Ngai in Judah gam a om nangawn i lau ua, Keilah khua a hohsuk a Philistia sepaihte vasual lauhuai zawsem nan chia” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David in Toupa a dong nawn hi. Toupa’n a dawng a, a kiang ah, “Thou inla, Keilah khua ah hohsuk in, Philistia mite na khut ah k’on pe ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in David leh a mite Keilah khua ah a hoh ua, Philistia mite a vasual ua, a gante uh a laksak ua, tamtak a that uh. Huchibang in David in Keilah khomite a humbitta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Ahimelek tapa Abiathar Keilah khua a David kiang a, a tailai in siampu puanak tawi in a paisuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keilah khua ah David a hoh chih Saul a hilh uh. Saul in, “Pathian in ka khut a amah honpia eive. Kulh kongpi leh a kalhna nei khua ah lah lut in a kikhumta ngal a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saul in mi tengteng kidou din Keilah khua va sual a David leh a mite va um din a samkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David in Saul in a tung ah thil hoihlou a sawm chih a na thei hi. Siampu Abiathar kiang ah, siampu puanak honla dihve, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in David in, “Aw Toupa , Israelte Pathian, Saul kei ziak a khua hihse din Keilah ah hong paisuk a tum, chih kei na sikha in ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keilah khua a mite’n a khut ah honpe ding uam? Na sikha in ka zak bang in Saul a hong paisuk diam? Aw Toupa , Israelte Pathian, hehpih in na sikha honhilh in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n , “A hongsuk ding” a chi hi. Huchi in David in, “Keilah khua mite’n kei leh ka mite Saul khut ah a honpe ding uam?” a chi hi. Toupa’n , “A honpe ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in David leh a mite, guk hiam tak a thou ua Keilah khua apan a pawt ua, a lemna lamlam ah a paita uh. David Keilah khua apan a tai kheta, chih Saul a hilh ua; huchi in kuankhiak a kikhel sakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David gamdai ah, leikawhawm ah a om hi. Ziph gamdai a tanggam ah a om nilouh hi. Saul in niteng in amah a zong a, himahleh Pathian in a khut ah a pekei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David in amah thah tum in Saul a hong kisa chih a thei a; huchi in David Ziph gamdai gamlak ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Saul tapa Jonathan a thou a, gamnuai ah David kiang ah a hoh a, David khut Toupa ah a hatsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kiang ah, “Lau hetken, ka pa Saul khut in a hong zongkhe kei ding, Israelte tung ah kumpi na honghi dia, kei nang hon zompa ka hi ding. Hiai leng ka pa Saul in a thei kilkel hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A nih un Toupa ma ah thukhun a bawl ua, David gamnuai ah a om nilouh a, Jonathan bel a inlam ah a paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in Ziph mite Gibeah ah Saul kiang ah a hohtou ua, David ka kiang uah gamnuai a leikawhawm ah, gamdai simlam sang Hakilah tang ah a na kibu nilouh a kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huaiziak in, aw kumpipa, hong paisuk na ut lamtak ahi bang in hong paisuk inla, kou ka hih ding uh ahihleh kumpipa khut amah honpiak ahi ding, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul in, “ Toupa’n hon vualzawl hen. Noute’n n’on hehpih mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pai unla, va chian nawnsem unla, a nung vazui unla, a mumi leng va chian hoihnawn sese un. Lepchiah piltak in thil a hihnak chih min a honhilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huaiziak in, a bukna mun tengteng thei sipsip unla, ka kiang ah hong nawn ngeingei unla, nou kiang ah keileng ka hong sam ding hi. Hichi ahi ding a, hiai gam a a om peuhmah leh Judah mi sang tampi lak apan ka zongkhe ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in a thou ua, Saul ma in Ziph ah a hoh uh. Himahleh David leh a mite gamdai simlam Arabah a Maon gamdai ah a om uhi. Huai mun Jashimon simlam a om ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saul leh a mite amah zong din a hoh uh. David a hilh ua, huchi in suangpi zuan in a pawtkhia hi. Maon gamdai ah David a delhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Saul tang langkhat lampang ah a pai a, David leh a mite bel tang langkhat lampang ah a pai uhi. David Saul lau in kintak in a tai a; Saul leh a mite’n lah David leh a mite mat tum in a um kimvel ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Himahleh Saul kiang ah, “Kinmeng inla, hongpai in, Philistia mite’n i gam uh a hongsual uh” chi’n thangkou a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in Saul in David a delhlai a kiksan hi. Philistia mite sual din a paita hi. Huaiziak in huai mun Sela hammah lekoth a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />David huai a kipan a paitou a, En gedi leikawhawm ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, Saul Philistia mite vadelh hong paikik in ngai in, “David En Gedi gamdai ah a om” chih hilh in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Saul in Israel mi tengteng lak a telkhiak tuam mi sang thum a pi a, sathakte tenna suangpi lak lam ah David leh a mite zong in a hohta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lamkal ah belam huang kawkhuk omna a va tung uh. Saul khawl din a valut hi. David leh a mite kawkhuk sunggil lam ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David mite’n, a kiang ah, “Ngai dih, Toupa’n na kiang ah, ngai in, na khut ah na melma k’on pedia, a tung ah hoih na saksak in na hih ding, a chih ni ahita ve” a chi uh. Huchi in David a thou a, simtham tak in Saul puan mong a vatan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a den chiang in Saul puanmong a vatan in David lungsim a sun mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in a mite kiang ah, Toupa sathaunilh ahi, chih thei napi a, a tung a khutzang a Toupa sathau nilh ka toupa tung a hiai thil ka hih louh ding hi a“ a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in huai thu in a mite a khamdai a, Saul sual dia a kuan uh a phalta kei hi. Saul bel kawkhuk apan a pawt a, a pai nawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nung zek in David leng a thou a, kawkhuk apan a pawt a, “Kumpipa, ka toupa” chi in Saul a nungsap hi. Saul nunglam ah a hong kihei a, David in a mai a lei ah a kunsuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David in Saul kiang ah, “Ngai in, David in na siatna a zong, chi a mite’n na kiang a, a gen uh bangdia gingta na hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai in, tuni in Toupa’n kawkhuk ah ka khut ah nang a honpia chih na mit mahmah in na mu hi. Mi khenkhatte’n nang that din a honchi uh. Himahleh ka honhawi hi. Ka toupa tung ah ka khut himhim ka khakei ding, Toupa sathau nilh ahi ngal a” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai kia leng hilou in, pa, en in, na puanmong leng ka tawi hi. Na puanmong ka tan theih a, k’on thah louh na ah ka khut ah thil hoihlou leh tatlekna a omkei, chih leh ka hinna laktum in honzong zong lechin leng, na tung ah ka khialkei chih thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n nang leh kei kikal ah vaihawm henla, Toupa’n na tung ah ka phu hon laksak hen. Himahleh ken zaw na tung ah khut ka kha kei himhim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nidanglai a paunak in, Migilou apan gitlouhna a pawt zel, a chi hi. Himahleh ken bel na tung ah khut ka kha kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel kumpipa kua zong in ahia a hongpawt khiak? Kua ahia na delh? Ui sisa, uihik lel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa vaihawmpa hi henla, nang toh kei kikal ah vaihawm hen, honmu in hon genpih henla, na khut apan hon hunkhia hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, David in Saul kiang a hiai thute a gen khit in, Saul in, “Hiai ka tapa David aw hilou a maw?” a chi hi. Huchi in aw suah in Saul a kapta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David kiang ah, “Kei sang in na diktat zaw, nang zaw ka tung ah thil hoih na hih a, ken bel thil hoihlou ka hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuni in ka tung a thil hoih na hih dan na hihlang a, Toupa’n na khut a kei a honpiak a leng n’on thah louhna ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Min a melma muta leh bangmahlou in a khahmawk diam? Huaiziak in, tuni a ka tung a na thilhih ah Toupa’n thil hoih in nang honthuk hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai in, kumpipa na hong hingei dia, Israel gam na khut a hihkip in a om ding chih ka theita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ka nung a ka suan hongom dingte hihmanglou ding in Toupa min in ka kiang ah kichiam inla, ka pa inkawte apan ka min thaimang ken” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in Saul kiang ah David a kichiam hi. Huchi in Saul inn ah a pai a, David leh a mite leikawhawm ah a paitou uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Samuel a sita a; Israel mi tengteng a hong paikhawm ua, amah a kah in Ramah khua ah a inn uah a vuita uhi. David a thou a Paran gamdai ah a hohsuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maon khua ah mi khat a om a, a neih leh lam Karmel tang ah a om hi. Amah mi thupitak ahi a, belam sang thum leh kel sang khat a nei hi. Karmel tang ah a belam mul a met hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A min Nabal ahi a, a zi min Abigail ahi. Huai numei teitak leh melhoih tak ahi. Himahleh pasal pen mi chihhak tak leh gilou tak ahi a; Kaleb suan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David in gamdai apan Nabal in a belam mul a met chih a naza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in David in tangval sawm a sawl a, tangvalte kiang ah “David in Karmel tang ah vahoh tou unla, Nabal kiang ah hoh unla ka min in chibai va buk un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi neizoupa kiang ah huchi in va chi un: ‘Nang tung ah, na inkuante tung ah leh na neih tengteng tung ah khamuanna om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na belam mul metmite a om uh chih ka naza hi. Na belamchingmite ka kiang ah a om zel ua, a poi uh bangmah ka khoihkei ua, Karmel tang a a omsung un bangmah a mangsak kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na tangvalte dong lechin a hon hilhmai ding uh. Huchi in hiai tangvalte a na hehpih in, ni hoih nitak a hong ka hi ngal ua. Na neih bangbang na sikhate leh na tapa David na pe dihve’ ” a chi, chi un, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David tangvalte a va tun un David min in huai thu tengteng Nabal kiang ah a gen ua, huchi in a daita uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nabal in David sikhate a dawng a, “David kua ahia oi? Jesse tapa kua ahia oi? Tulai in sikha tampi pute taimangsan a tam uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka tanghou, ka tui leh ka belam mulmet mite adia ka gohsa kuate ahi ua chih ka theihlouhte ka pe mahmah dia hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in David tangvalte a kihei ua, a kiknawn ua; huai thu tengteng a honghilh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in a mite kiang ah, “Na namsau uh kuah chiat un,” a chi hi. A namsau uh a kuah chiat uh. David in leng a namsau a kuah a, mi za li tak in David a zuitou ua; mi za nih van veng in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tangval khat in Nabal zi Abigail kiang ah, “Ngai in, David in gamdai apan ka pu uh chibai buk din mi a honsawl a, aman a na sal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh huaite lah ka tung uah a hoih mahmah ua, ka poi uh bangmah a khoih kei uh. Gamlak a ka omlai ua ka omkhawm sung tengteng uh bangmah ka tan kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Belamching a a kiang ua ka omsung tengteng un sun leh zan kou adin bang ahi mai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaiziak in, bang ahia na hih ding hoihtak in ngaihtuah dihve. Ka pu uh tung ah leh a inkuan tengteng tung ah thil hoihlou tup in a nei hi. Amah lah a Belial tapa mahmah a, kuamah houpih theih ahi kei hi” chi’n a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Abigail in kintak in tanghou beu za nih, uain thawl nih, belam nga huan dia mansa, vaimim kan buk nga, grep gah phoukeu bawk za, leh theipi beu za nih a la khawm a, sabiltung a pawsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A sikha tangvalte kiang ah, “Ka ma ah na pai zel unla, ngai un, ka honzui ding” a chi hi. Himahleh a pasal Nabal a hilh kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in hichibang ahi a, a sabiltung tung a tuang a tangsang sing lak a a paisuk lai in, ngai in, David leh a mite’n a honzuan ua, huchi in amau a tuakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />David in, “Bangmah a mansak louhna dia gamdai a hiai mipa neih tengteng a thawn lel in ka na vensak a na hi mahmah ve. Thil hoih lah thil hoihlou in a hon dinta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zingchiang zingsang khovak pha a amah a tengteng lak a pasal naupang khat kia lel leng ka hawi peuhmah leh Pathian in David melmate thupizaw sem in bawl hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Abigail in David a muh in a sabiltung apan a kumsuk zok a, David ma a leisi in a kunsuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A khe bul ah a khupboh a, “Keimah in, ka toupa aw, keimahmah in thulimlouhna ka khu ding. Na sikhanu’n na bil a zak din thu gen henla, na sikhanu thugen hehpih in ngaikhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka toupa aw, Belial mi Nabal bangmah in sim ken. A min bangbang ahi geih hi. Nabal ahi namah a, a hai hi. Kei na sikhanu in zaw ka toupa’n n’on sawl tangvalte ka na mukha kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuin, toupa aw, Toupa hinna leh na hinna lou in ka gen hi. Ka mu mahmah kei hi, Toupa’n sisan suahlou ding leh na khut a phu la lou din lah nang a honbawl hi. Na melmate leh ka toupa hoihlouhna zongmite Nabal bang himai uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hiai ka toupa adia na sikha in vualzawlnate ka hontawi ka pu honzui tangvalte piak hi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na sikhanu tatlekna hehpih in ngaidam in. Toupa’n ka toupa inkuan kiptak in a phut ngeingei dia, ka pu Toupa kidounate dou ahi ngal a. Na damsung teng in nangmah gitlouh man muh ding a omkei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nang hon delh ding leh na hinna hihmang din mite hong kisa mahle uh, ka toupa hinna zaw Toupa na Pathian toh hinna a gak ahi dia; na melmate hinna bel vaisuanglot a suanglot bang in a lonmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, Toupa’n na tungtang thu a thil hoih a chiam bang teng ka toupa tung a a hih chiang a, Israelte kumpipa dia a honbawl chiang in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A ziak omlou a sisan na suahlouh a, ka toupa’n phu na laklouh nang adin lungkhamna himhim ahi kei ding. Ka toupa adin leng lungkimlouhna himhim ahi sam kei ding. Toupa’n ka toupa tung a thil hoih a hih hun chiang in na sikhanu theigige in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David in Abigail kiang ah, “Tuni a kei hon na dawn dia hon sawlpa Toupa , Israelte Pathian phat in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na lemtheihna vualzawl in om henla, nang sisan suah mawhna apan hon humnu leh keimah khut a phu lalou dia hon bawlnu vualzawl in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kei hon dawn dia hong pawtkhe pahlou hile chin, Toupa , Israelte Pathian hinna lou in ka gen hi, zingchiang khovak pha in Nabal ka hawisak hetkei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huchi in David in a thiltawite a la a, a kiang ah, “Lungmuangtakin na inn ah paitouta in. Na thu ka mang hi. Na nget pen k’on sansak hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Abigail Nabal kiang ah a hohtou hi. Ngai in, a inn ah kumpipa Ankuanglui bang mai in Ankuang a na lui hi. A kham mahmah ziak in Nabal a maitai ngial hi. Huaiziak in, a zingsang khovak masiah bangmah a hilh kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, zinglam a Nabal uain kham a halh in a zi in huai thute a hilh a, a lung a daiduak a, suang bang in a hong omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, ni sawm nung in Toupa’n Nabal tung ah khut a kha a, a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />David in Nabal a si chih a zak in, “Ka minsiatna dia Nabal thilhih apan hon genpih a, a sikha thil hoihlou hihlou dia hon khampa Toupa phat in om hen. Nabal thil hoihlou hih Toupa’n amah tung mah ah a kesakta” a chi hi. Huchi in David in Abigail a zi dia va houpih din mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />David sikhate’n Karmel tang a Abigail kiang a tun touh un, “David in a zi dia nang hong pi din a honsawl” chi’n amah a houpih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A thou a, a mai a leisi in a kunsuk hi. “Ngai dih ua, na sikhanu uh ka toupa sikhate khesil ding sikha ka hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Huchi in Abigail a thouzok a, sabiltung tung ah a tuang a, a nungzui nungak ngate toh David mi sawlte a zui ua, a zi in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />David in Jezreel a mi Ahinoam leng a na pikhin a; huchi in a zi din a om tuaktuak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Saul in lah a tanu Mikal David zi Gallim khua a mi Laish tapa Palti toh a na kitengsak zouta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Ziphte Gibeah ah Saul kiang ah a hoh ua, “David gamdai chin a Hakilah tang ah a kibu kei maw?” chi in a vagen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Saul a thou a, Ziph gamdai ah Israel mite lak apan tel khiak mi sang thum pi in Ziph gamdai ah David zong din a hoh sukta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saul in gamdai chin, lamkal ah Hakilah tang ah panmun a khoh a, David gamdai ah a omlai hi. Saul amah zong in gamdai ah a hong chih a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huaiziak in, David in enkhemite a sawl a, Saul a hong taktak chih a thei telta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David a thou a, Saul panmun khohna ah a hoh hi. David in Saul leh a sepaih heutu, Ner tapa Abner lupna a mu hi. Saul kangtalai um sung ah a lum a, a kim ah mite’n om mun a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David in Hit mi Abimelek leh Joab unau Zeruiah tapa Abisai kiang ah, “Saul panmun ah kua ahia ka kiang a hongding?” chi’n a gen hi. Abisai in, “Kei na kiang ah ka hongsuk sam ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in David leh Abisai mipite omna ah zan in a va hoh uhi. Ngai in, Saul bel kangtalai um sung ah lum in a ihmu hi. A lu lam ah a teipi lei ah a siat tal a, Abner leh mite bel a kim ah lum in a ihmu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abisai in David kiang ah, “Tuni in Pathian in na melma na khut a honpia eive. Huaiziak in, teipi in khatvei in lei ah k’on sunden suk ding aw? Ka sun tuan nawn kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh David in Abisai kiang ah, “Hih mangthang ken, Toupa thaunilh tung a khut kha a mawhlou kua a om thei a?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David mah in, “ Toupa hinna lou in ka gen hi. Toupa’n a tung ah khut kha na ve. Ahihkeileh leng a sih ni a hongtung na ding. Ahihkeileh leng, kidouna ah a hoh dia, a mangthang mai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa thaunilh tung ah khut ka kha hetkei ding. A lu kiang chin a teipi leh tuithawl ahihleh la inla, pai ni” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in David in Saul lu kiang chin a teipi leh tuithawl a la a, a pai nawnta uh. Kuamah in a mu kei ua, kuamah in phawkin a khanglou sam kei. Toupa’n nuamtak a a ihmut sak ziak in avek un nakpi’n a ihmu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in David galkhat lam ah a hoh a, gamla kuam ah mualvum ah ading a; a kikal uh gamlapi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David in mipite leh Ner tapa Abner zak in a kikou a, “Abner, n’on dawng kei dia hia?” chi in a sam hi. Huchi in Abner in a dawng a, “Kumpipa sam nang kua na hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David in Abner kiang ah, “Mi hangsan na hi kei maw? Israelte lak ah nang bang kua a om a? Bangchidan ahia kumpipa, na toupa na ven louh? Kumpipa, na pu hihmang din kuahiam khat a hongpai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na thilhih dan a hoihkei. Toupa hinna lou in ka gen hi. Toupa thaunilh toupa na ven hoihlouh ziak in si dia kilawm na hi. Kumpipa lu chin a teipi leh tuithawl om koi a om ahita a? En him dih” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saul in David aw a thei a, “Tua nang aw hia, ka tapa David?” a chi hi. David in, “He, toupa, kumpipa aw, ka aw ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Bangziak in ahia ka toupa in a sikha a delh? Bang thil ka hih a ahia? A khut ah thil gilou bang ahia om?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huaiziak in, toupa, ka kumpipa’n a sikha thu ngaikhia hen. Kei dou dia na lungtang tokthoupa Toupa ahihleh thillat pom teitei hen. Mihing tate a hih uleh Toupa ah hamsia thuak in om uhen. Pai inla, pathian dangte na sem in, chi a Toupa gou ka luah theihlouhna dia tuni a hon delhmang lah ahi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ka sisan Toupa muh phaklouh in lei ah luang kei hen. Vengkeng gem dia tang a mi a gamvak bang un Israel kumpipa uihik leltak zong dia paikhia eive” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul in, “Ka na khialta hi. Ka tapa David, hongpai nawn in. Tuni a na mitmuh a ka hinna a manphat mahmah ziak in bangmah himhim ka hihta kei ding hi. Ngai in, thil haihuai mahmah ka na hihta a, ka nak khelh mahmah hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in a dawng a, “toupa aw, teipi en dih, tangval khat hong henla, hongla hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa’n michih a diktat man uleh a muanhuai man uh a pe ding. Tuni’n Toupa’n ka khut ah nang a honpe na a, Toupa thaunilh tung ah ka khut ka lik nuam kei a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ngai in, tuni a na hinna k’on mantam sak mahmah bang in Toupa’n ka hinna hon mantam sak henla, mangbatna tengteng apan hon hunkhia hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in Saul in David kiang ah, “Ka tapa David, vualzawl in om in. Thilhihthei tak in na om dia, na zouzel ding” a chi hi. Huchi in David a pai a, Saul leng a mun ah a pai nawnta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, David in a lungsim in, “Chikchiang hiam a zaw Saul khut a mangthang khongkhong ding kei ve. Philistia mite gam a taimang sang a hoih zaw omlou ding ahi. Huchi in Saul in Israel gam a hon zonna a lungdong dia, huchi in a khut apan ka suakta ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David a thou a, amah leh a kiang a mi za guk omte Maok tapa Gath kumpipa Akish kiang ah a paita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David leh a mite, michih a inkuan kuan un, David zi nihte, Jezreel mi Ahinoam leh Nabal zi Karmel mi Abigail te toh Gath khua ah Akish kiang ah a tengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David Gath khua ah a tai chih Saul a hilh ua, huchi in a zong nawnta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David in Akish kiang ah, “Hon hehpih inla, na gam a khua khat ah tenna ding mun hon pesam inla, huai ah ka teng ding uh. Na sikha bang ding in kumpipa khua ah na kiang ah a om nilouh dia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Akish in huai ni’n Ziklag khua a peta hi. Huaiziak in, Ziklag tunitan in Judah gam kumpipate a ahi nilouh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Philistia gam a David a omsung kum khat pumpi leh kha li ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David leh a mite a vahoh tou ua, Geshur mite, Girzi mite leh Amalek mite a vadou uhi. Huai namte Telam apan Shur gam lampang Aigupta gam pha a om ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David in gam a sual a, numei leh pasal hawi himhim a neikei. Belamte, bawngte, sabiltungte, sangawngsaute leh a puansilhte uh a laksak hi. A pai nawn a, Akish kiang ah a hoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Akish in, “Tuni’n koilam na dou a?” a chi hi. David in, “Judah sim gam, Jerahmeelte sim gam leh Kente sim gam” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Philistia gam a a omsung mawngmawng in ‘David in hichibang in a hihzel,’ ” a chi kha ding ua, chi in numei pasal Gath khua a pi ding hawi himhim a neikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Akish in David thugen a taksang a, “A mi Israelte a kimudah sak mahmah ziak in, tangtawn in ka sikha din a om ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, huailai in Philistia mite’n a sepaihte uh Israel mite sual a dou din a kaikhawm uh. Akish in David kiang ah, “Nang leh na mite kei toh galdou dia na hong kuan ngeingei ding uh ahi, chih thei in” a chi hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in Akish kiang ah, “Awle, na sikha in bang a hihthei a chih na thei ding” a chi hi. Akish in David kiang ah, “A hoih ve, kei hon vengpa din k’on bawl den ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Samuel a sita a, Israel mi tengteng in a kah ua, amah khua mah Ramah ah a vui uhi. Saul in dawi aisansiam zawlte leh dawisiamte a gam apan a delhkhe khin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Philistia mite a ki kaikhawm ua, Shunem ah panmun a khoh uh. Saul in Israel mi tengteng a kaikhawm a, Gilboa ah panmun a khoh sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul in Philistia sepaihte a muhtak in a lau a, a lungsim a ling tonton maimah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul in Toupa a dot in leng Toupa mang hiam, Urim hiam, zawlnei hiam in leng a dawng himhim kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saul in a sikhate kiang ah, “Dawi aisansiam zawl numei a kiang a ka hoh a ka dot ding hon zon khiaksak un,” a chi hi. A sikhate’n a kiang ah, “Ngai in, Endor khua a dawi aisansiam numei om eive” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saul a kibawl lamdang a, puan dang a silh a, amah leh midang nih a hoh uh. Zan in numei kiang a va tung uhi. Dawi aisanna in ai honsan sak inla, na kiang a, a min ka gen peuhmah hon sapsak in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Numei in a kiang ah, “Ngai in, Saul thilhih na thei a, a gam a dawi aisansiam leh dawisiamte a hihmang khinta a, bangdia ka sihna dia ka hinna thangkam khum dia kisa na hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul in “ Toupa minlou in, Toupa hinna lou in ka gen hi. Hiai thil ziak in na tung ah gawtna a tungkei ding” chi’n a kiang ah a kichiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Numei in, “Kua k’on sapkhiaksak dia?” a chi hi. Aman, “Samuel hon sapkhiaksak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Numei in Samuel a muh leh ngaihtak in a kikou a, Saul kiang ah, “Bangdia hon zekhem, Saul lah na hi ngal a?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Lau ken. Bang a na muh?” a chi hi. Numei in Saul kiang ah, “Lei apan pathiante hong pawtkhia ka mu” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kiang ah, “Bangchi bang ahia?” a chi hi. Aman, “Putekpi a hongpawt a, puanaktual a silh” a chi hi. Saul in Samuel ahi chih a thei a, a mai a leisi in a kun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuel in Saul kiang ah, “Bangdia hihbuai a honsam khia na hia?” a chi hi. Saul in a dawng a, “Ka lung a zing mahmah a ahi. Philistia mite’n a hondou ua, Pathian in lah a hon lehngatsan a, zawlnei hiam, mang hiam in leng lah a hon dawng himhim kei hi. Huaiziak in, ka hih ding honhilh din ka honsam ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Samuel in, “Huchi a Toupa hon lehngatsan in na melma a hong hita, chih theigige kawm a bangdia thu hon dong?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei honzang a, a gen bang in Toupa’n na tung a hih eita ve. Toupa’n na khut apan gam a honsuta, na invengpa David a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa thu na manlouh ziak leh Amalekte tung a a heh mahmah dungzui a na tangtun louh ziak in. Tuin na tung ah hiai thil a hihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huailou leng, Toupa’n nang leh Israelte leng Philistia mite khut ah a honpe dia; zingchiang in nang leh na tapate ka kiang ah na hongom ding uh. Toupa’n Israel sepaihte leng Philistia mite khut ah a pe ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in Samuel thugen ziak in Saul a lau mahmah a, lei ah a puk vialvual maimah hi. Tha leh zung himhim a neikei a, nitum leh zankhua a an ne lou ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Numeinu Saul kiang ah a hoh a, a dah mahmah chih a thei hi. A kiang ah, “Ngai in, na sikhanu in na gen ka taksang a, sih leh sih ka kiang a na thugente ka zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huaiziak in, nang leng na sikhanu thu taksang sam in. An tawmchik bek ka honlui dia, huchi in na pai chiang a hatna na neih theihna din ne in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh a utkei a, “Ka nekei ding” a chi hi. Himahleh a sikhate’n numei toh a sawl teitei ua; a thu uh a mangta hi. Lei apan a thou a, lupna ah a tuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Numei in bawngnou vakthau a inn ah a nei a, a gouzok a; tangbuang a la a, a mek a, silngou sohlouh tanghou a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saul leh a sikhate ma ah a lui a, a na neta uh. Huchi in a thou ua, huai zan in a paita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Philistia mite’n a sepaih tengteng uh Aphek ah a kaikhawm vek ua, Israel mite’n Jezreel a tuikhuk kiang ah panmun a khoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Philistia kumpipate a zaza in, a sangsang in a pai ua, David leh a mite’n Akish toh a nung uh a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Philistia Kumpipate’n, “Hiai Hebrute’n bang ahia a hih uh?” a chi uh. Akish in Philistia kumpipa kiang ah, “Hiai David Israelte kumpipa Saul sikha, hichi tan a ka kiang a omkhin a, ka kiang a, a honglut nung a lah tu tan a leng a diklouhna ka muhlouhna pa ahi kei maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh Philistia kumpipate a tung ah a heh uhi. Philistia kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Hiai mi na mun sehsak a pai din kiksak inla, kidouna ah i kiang uah hongsuk kei heh. Huchilou in zaw kidouna ah i melmate lam ah a pangkha ding. Hiai mite lu din hiai mipa leh a pu kilem nawn ve un teh aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hiai David mah ahi kei maw, Saul in asang asang a that, David in asing asing, chi a, a tungtang thu la a sak uh?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Akish in David a sam a, a kiang ah, “ Toupa hinna lou in ka gen ahi. Mi dik mahmah na hi a, sepaihte lak a ka kiang a na kuan leh na hong leltak ka mitmuh in a hoih mahmah hi. Ka kiang a na hong ni apan tunitan in na tung ah bangmah hoihlouhna himhim ka mu hetkei hi. Himahleh Kumpipate’n a hon ngaikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Philistia kumpipate na hih lungkimlouh louhna din kik inla, lungkimtakin pai in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David in Akish kiang ah, “Ahihleh, bang thil ahia ka na hih? Na kiang a ka omsung teng in tunitan in, ka toupa kumpipa melma dou lou a ka kiknawn maimah ding, na sikha tung ah bang mu na hia oi?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Akish in a dawng a, “David kiang ah, Ka mitmuh in Pathian angel bang in na hoih chih ka thei hi. Himahleh Philistia Kumpipate’n, Kidouna ah i kiang ah a hongsam kei ding, a chi bikbek mawk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in, na kiang a om na pu sikhate toh zingkhang in thou unla, zingkhang a na thohphet ua khua a vak chiang in pai un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in David leh a mite Philistia gam a kiknawn din zingsang a pawtkhe ding in a thouta uh. Philistia mite Jezreel ah a hohtou uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, ni thum ni a David leh a mite Ziklag a tun un, Amalekte’n simlam leh Ziklag khua a na sim khin uh. Ziklag khua a na sual ua, mei in a na hal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Numeite leh khua a om peuhmah a lian, a neu sal in a man ua, kuamah thatlou a pi in a paipih khinta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David leh a mite khua a vatun un, ngai in, a na kangsiang khinta hi. A zite, a tapate leh a tanute uh sal in a na mankhinta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David leh a kiang a omte’n aw suah in kah leng kap zou nawnlou khop in a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David zite nih: Jezreel mi Ahinoam leh Karmel mi Nabal zi Abigail leng sal in a pikhinta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David a lungzing mahmah hi. Michih a tapate uh leh a tanute uh ziak a lungkham in amah suang a den ding thu a gen ziak un. Himahleh David bel Toupa a Pathian ah a ki hihhat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in Ahimelek tapa siampu Abiathar kiang ah, “siampu puanak hon valaksak dihve” a chi hi. Abiathar in David siampu puanak a va laksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David in, “Hiaite delh leng ka phalai diam?” chi in Toupa a dong hi. Aman a dawng a, “Delh in, na pha ngeingei ding, na lanawn vek ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in David a kuanta a, amah leh a kiang a mi za guk toh. Besor lui a va tung ua, a mi nutsiatte uh huai ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David in a delhzel a, amah leh mi za lite toh, mi za nihte’n a bahtak ziak un Besor lui a kan zoukei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gamlak ah Aigupta mi a mu ua, David kiang ah a pi ua, tanghou a pia ua, aman a ne a, tui a dawnsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Theipi beu them khat leh grep gah phoukeu bawm nih a pia uh. Hiaite a nek leh a hong halh nawn a; ni thum leh zan thum an ne lou leh tui dawnlou lah ahita ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in a kiang ah, “Kua na hia? Kaw kipan a hong na hia?” a chi hi. Aman, “Aigupta gam tangval, Amalek mi sikha ka hi. Ni thum ahita a, ka chi a nat ziak in ka pu in a hon nusia maimah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kereth sim gam leh Judah sim gamte ka sim ua, Kaleb sim gam leng ka sim uhi. Ziklag khua leng ka hal uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David in a kiang ah, “Huaite omna ah n’on pisuk thei diam?” a chi hi. Aman, “Hon thatlou ding leh ka pu khut a hon penawn lou din Pathian min lou in ka kiang ah kichiam inla, huchi in huaite omna ah k’on pisuk ding,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A pisuk leh, ngai in, Philistia gam leh Judah gam a gallak tampi a lak ziak un Ankuang a lui ua, a ne un a dawn ua mun teng ah a na om dalh pheng phung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in David in nitum apan zingsang nitaklam tan in amau a sual hi. Tangval za li sangawngsau tung a tuang a taikekte kia loungal kuamah dam a suakta himhim a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />David in Amalek mite puakmang tengteng a lanawn vek a, David in a zi nihte leng a hunkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in a lian, a neu in, a tapate uh, a tanute uh, a gallak uh leh a thillak himhim bangmah tan a neikei ua, David in a laksak nawn vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />David in belamhon leh ganhon tengteng a la a, gan dangte ma ah a hawl ua, “Hiaite David gallak ahi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi za nih a bah ziak ua David zuizou nawnlou a Besor lui a a omsakte uh kiang ah David a vatung hi. Amau David dawn ding leh a kiang a omte dawn din a pawtkhia uh. Mite kiang a tun in David in amaute chibai a buk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David kiang a hohte lak migiloute leh Belial mi teng in a dawng ua, “I kiang ua a hong tellouh ziak un gallak thil i va lak nawn himhimte amau i pekei ding uh. A pi ua a pai theihna ding un a zite chiat uh leh a tate chiat uh ahihleh a pi uh i phal ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />David in, “Unaute aw, Toupa eite hon kembit pa’n a honpiak leh eite dou dia hong kuante i khut ua hon pepa thilte huchi in hihkei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kuan ahia hiai thu a na thu uh zui ding? Kidouna a hohte tan bangmah van veng a na omte’n leng a tansam ding uh ahi; kibang vek a tan ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huai ni apan tunitan in Israelte adia thupiak leh dan din a bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />David Ziklag khua a tun in, gallak khenkhat, Hiai, Toupa melmate lak a gallak, nang adia thilpiak, chi’n, Judah upate, a lawmte ngei kiang ah, gallak khenkhat a khak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bethel a omte kiang ah, Ramoth sim a omte kiang ah, Jattir a omte kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aroer a omte kiang ah, Siphmoth a omte kiang ah, Eshtermoa a omte kiang ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rakal a omte kiang ah, Jerameel khua a omte kiang ah, Kente khua a omte kiang ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hormah a omte kiang ah, Korashan a omte kiang ah, A thak a omte kiang ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hebron a omte kiang ah, David leh a mite tatna mun tengteng kiang ah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Philistia mite’n Israelte a sual ua; Israelte Philistia mite apan a taikek ua, Gilboa tang ah thah in a om zelzul uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Philistia mite’n Saul leh a tapa a delhzui vengveng uh. Philistia mite’n Saul tapate: Jonathan, Abinadab leh Melkishua a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saul a naksual mahmah ua, thalkap mite’n a kap khat a ua, thal kapmite’n nasatakin a kapliam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in Saul in a galvan tawipa kiang ah, “Na namsau dok inla, honsun pailet in. Huchilou in zaw hiai zeksumlouhte a hongpai ding ua, a hong sun pailet ding ua, a hon bawlse kha ding uh” a chi hi. Himahleh a galvan tawipan a hih utkei; a lau mahmah ngal a. huaiziak in, Saul in a namsau a la a, a boh khumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A galvan tawipan Saul a si chih a theih in aman leng a namsau a boh khum samta a, a sikhawmta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Saul, a tapa thumte, a galvan tawipa leh a mi tengteng huai ni mah in a sikhawm vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Guam galkhat lam a Israel mi omte leh Jordan gal a omte’n Israel mite a taikek uh, chih leh Saul leh a tapate a si uh chih a theih un khuate a pawt khiaksan ua, a taimangta uhi. Huchi in Philistia mite’n a va luahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a zingsang in Philistiate a galthahte uh puansilh suahsak dia a vapai uleh Saul leh a tapate thum Gilboa tang a si a va mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A lu a tan ua, a galvan a suahkhiak sak ua, mite kiang leh a milim pathiante inn a suah din a kim ua Philistia mite gam teng ah a khak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A galvan Ashtaroth inn ah a koih ua; a luang Bethsan kulhbang ah a tak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jabesh-Gilead a omte’n Philistia mite’n Saul a bawldan thu a na zak un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi hangsan tengteng a thou ua, zankhua in a pai ua, Saul luang leh a tapate luang Bethshan kulhbang apan a la uh. Jabesh a tung ua, huai ah a hal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A guhte a la ua, Jabesh a sing nuai ah a vui ua, ni sagih sung an a ngawl uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
